WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Downloaded from CINEFREAK.NET

00:02:24.625 --> 00:02:27.875
In this busy life, with
so many things to do,

00:02:28.333 --> 00:02:31.000
Thank you for choosing to watch this film.

00:02:31.666 --> 00:02:33.208
As kids, we grew up
listening to countless stories

00:02:33.666 --> 00:02:34.833
We read comic books,

00:02:35.208 --> 00:02:39.958
Filled with fascinating characters— angels,
witches, wizards, spaceships, and more.

00:02:40.583 --> 00:02:44.208
What if we made a film
in the comic-book style we loved as kids?

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.000
That's what Drones is all about.

00:02:46.791 --> 00:02:49.958
Many things in this world
engage our logical and critical thinking.

00:02:50.583 --> 00:02:54.041
But this film is meant to bring out
the child within us

00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:56.541
and entertain that inner child.

00:02:57.166 --> 00:02:58.958
So, while watching this film,
put your phone on flight mode.

00:02:59.375 --> 00:03:01.916
and your mind on child mode.

00:03:02.166 --> 00:03:03.750
You'll have a great experience.

00:06:00.125 --> 00:06:00.833
Cerlac.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:01.541
Sir.

00:06:02.625 --> 00:06:04.416
Either I should be alive today,

00:06:04.875 --> 00:06:06.291
or that psycho should be alive.

00:06:06.958 --> 00:06:08.708
Then that psycho will
definitely be alive, sir.

00:06:10.125 --> 00:06:10.833
I didn't mean that, sir.

00:06:11.291 --> 00:06:13.166
It's not an ordinary
psycho, like you think.

00:06:14.291 --> 00:06:16.541
(whistles)

00:06:18.083 --> 00:06:19.166
It's a dancing psycho.

00:06:20.416 --> 00:06:22.041
What's that dancing psycho?

00:06:22.541 --> 00:06:23.166
Sir!

00:06:23.583 --> 00:06:26.291
He will steal something
from us and run fast.

00:06:26.416 --> 00:06:28.540
If we chase after him...

00:06:28.541 --> 00:06:30.541
He will make us come to a dead end,

00:06:31.041 --> 00:06:33.041
...he'll suddenly turn
around and start dancing, sir.

00:06:33.875 --> 00:06:38.041
If we copy his dance moves and
dance in front of him, we'll be safe.

00:06:38.583 --> 00:06:39.333
If we fail to do so,

00:06:40.333 --> 00:06:41.041
Then it's murder.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.208
He is Koomapatti Madhavan.

00:06:44.708 --> 00:06:45.416
Age 40,

00:06:45.958 --> 00:06:47.583
For him, finding the
murderer is a part-time job.

00:06:47.833 --> 00:06:50.083
Finding a bride is his full-time job.

00:06:50.583 --> 00:06:53.500
Horoscope, astrology, numerology—
he's been rejected everywhere.

00:06:53.958 --> 00:06:54.833
But still he is not married,

00:06:55.791 --> 00:06:56.875
Right from a young age,

00:06:57.416 --> 00:06:59.250
back when he was still eating Cerelac,

00:06:59.625 --> 00:07:03.750
his dream of becoming a detective
turned into a character

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.541
and entered the story
all by itself.

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:07.625
His name is Cerelac Homes.

00:07:08.083 --> 00:07:09.708
Instead of calling him an assistant,

00:07:10.041 --> 00:07:11.958
we can call him Koomapatti
Madhavan's alter ego.

00:07:12.708 --> 00:07:13.791
These two are fine,

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:16.125
but you're wondering about the
one dancing in the middle, right?

00:07:16.958 --> 00:07:18.083
See for yourself who he is.

00:07:19.458 --> 00:07:20.666
Let him come today.

00:07:21.041 --> 00:07:22.458
Let's see whether it's him or me.

00:07:22.583 --> 00:07:23.291
Oh no!
Gun!

00:07:23.916 --> 00:07:24.416
Sir!

00:07:24.541 --> 00:07:25.749
Dancing psycho, sir!

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:26.458
Hey! Come on!

00:07:26.833 --> 00:07:28.541
Sir! Don't go!
I don't even know how to dance.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:07.666
Sir!

00:08:07.791 --> 00:08:08.541
He is stripping.

00:08:11.416 --> 00:08:11.833
Sir!

00:08:12.041 --> 00:08:12.625
Let's run away.

00:08:21.791 --> 00:08:23.208
Hey!
Who is he?

00:08:23.625 --> 00:08:25.083
Didn't you say you don't know how to dance?

00:08:25.875 --> 00:08:26.375
Sir!

00:08:26.625 --> 00:08:29.666
Sir, even people who can't
dance are trending with this step.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.458
If you can't even do this step,

00:08:31.791 --> 00:08:33.250
there's nothing wrong with you dying.

00:08:34.166 --> 00:08:35.915
You better dance now,
Sir. Else he will shoot you.

00:08:35.916 --> 00:08:36.708
will he shoot me?

00:08:47.416 --> 00:08:50.166
Those watching the video, please
like, comment, and subscribe.

00:08:50.291 --> 00:08:51.916
Don't forget to click the bell icon.

00:08:52.875 --> 00:08:54.166
Hey! hey! Catch him!

00:08:54.416 --> 00:08:55.249
He is here.

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:57.040
Who are they?
They are dancing like cheer girls.

00:08:57.041 --> 00:08:57.666
Idiot, Get up!

00:08:57.833 --> 00:08:59.040
Why's he pedaling a bicycle with his hands?

00:08:59.041 --> 00:08:59.750
Sorry, sir.

00:08:59.875 --> 00:09:00.708
Don't take it wrong, Sir.

00:09:01.375 --> 00:09:02.333
He is my friend, sir.

00:09:02.625 --> 00:09:03.958
He's sleep-dancing!

00:09:04.208 --> 00:09:04.750
Police?

00:09:10.583 --> 00:09:11.750
Hey! Come..Come..Come...

00:09:11.916 --> 00:09:12.958
Both of you step out.

00:09:13.541 --> 00:09:14.041
Come!
Come!

00:09:14.333 --> 00:09:14.833
Move.

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:16.625
Hey, you with the braid, move to the front.

00:09:19.875 --> 00:09:20.750
What is your name?

00:09:21.208 --> 00:09:21.625
Kish!

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:23.125
Kiss?

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:23.790
Sir!

00:09:23.791 --> 00:09:24.250
Kisho...

00:09:24.666 --> 00:09:25.583
Keep quiet.

00:09:26.625 --> 00:09:27.333
Kishore, sir.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.708
In short, Kish.

00:09:29.208 --> 00:09:30.166
Kishore itself is short.

00:09:30.291 --> 00:09:31.250
Why shorten it further?

00:09:31.625 --> 00:09:32.250
What is your name?

00:09:32.458 --> 00:09:32.958
Rashmika.

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:34.833
In short, Rush.

00:09:35.458 --> 00:09:37.250
And your name is Bush?

00:09:37.583 --> 00:09:37.833
No.

00:09:38.166 --> 00:09:38.500
Dush.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:39.916
I will deal with you later.

00:09:40.208 --> 00:09:42.666
I have heard about sleepwalking.

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:46.666
But you run, jump, dance...

00:09:47.083 --> 00:09:50.166
I thought you must be that dancing psycho.

00:09:50.333 --> 00:09:50.916
Sir! Sir!

00:09:51.083 --> 00:09:51.708
We ain't worth the hype.

00:09:51.916 --> 00:09:53.291
He sees ghosts in his dreams every day.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:54.250
Ghosts?

00:09:54.833 --> 00:09:55.500
Yes, sir.

00:09:55.833 --> 00:09:58.416
I've been facing this problem for a month.

00:09:59.541 --> 00:10:01.000
What's with all these stories?

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:01.625
Sir!

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:03.041
It is not an ordinary ghost.

00:10:03.791 --> 00:10:05.083
It looks beautiful.

00:10:05.791 --> 00:10:07.416
If you go near it,

00:10:07.541 --> 00:10:09.250
it'll turn into a demon
and start chasing you.

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:11.666
A female ghost?

00:10:16.541 --> 00:10:19.708
Cerlac, what needs to be
done to get dreams like this?

00:10:20.458 --> 00:10:21.041
Sir!

00:10:21.458 --> 00:10:22.083
Tell.

00:10:23.125 --> 00:10:24.208
He watched a movie last month, sir.

00:10:24.416 --> 00:10:25.500
That's when it started.

00:10:27.166 --> 00:10:27.750
What is the name of the movie?

00:10:28.166 --> 00:10:29.083
Drones.

00:10:42.916 --> 00:10:44.125
Sir! Sir!
Please, sir.

00:10:44.333 --> 00:10:45.625
- Please help me, sir.
- I can't.

00:10:45.958 --> 00:10:48.000
If you're under suspension from college,
you can't stay in the hostel either.

00:10:48.208 --> 00:10:49.666
You have gone to the police station.

00:10:49.916 --> 00:10:51.624
You guys ruined the college's
reputation. Please leave.

00:10:51.625 --> 00:10:52.791
- Sir.
- Sir..Sir.

00:10:52.916 --> 00:10:53.666
Mom...

00:10:53.916 --> 00:10:54.458
Stop it.

00:10:54.958 --> 00:10:56.666
Which idiot told you that I got suspended?

00:10:56.875 --> 00:10:58.124
Your HOD Sai told me.

00:10:58.125 --> 00:10:59.000
I didn't get suspended.

00:10:59.625 --> 00:11:00.624
Dear, I'm worried.

00:11:00.625 --> 00:11:01.582
How can I believe you?

00:11:01.583 --> 00:11:02.625
I will give it to my ma'am.

00:11:02.791 --> 00:11:03.583
You ask her.

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:04.708
Okay, dear.
Give it to her.

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:05.708
I will ask her.

00:11:05.958 --> 00:11:06.416
Get lost.

00:11:06.791 --> 00:11:08.041
Mom, one minute, I will give it to ma'am.

00:11:08.208 --> 00:11:09.250
- Give it to her.
- Talk...

00:11:09.666 --> 00:11:10.083
Hello!

00:11:10.833 --> 00:11:11.291
Hello!

00:11:11.583 --> 00:11:13.499
I am Kishore's teacher.

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:13.791
Madam!

00:11:14.083 --> 00:11:16.540
I heard that my son got suspended from
the college.

00:11:16.541 --> 00:11:17.208
Suspended?

00:11:17.333 --> 00:11:18.708
Which idiot told you this?

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.250
He is a good student.

00:11:21.125 --> 00:11:23.250
If you don't believe your own son,
What kind of a woman are you?

00:11:23.666 --> 00:11:24.333
No, ma'am.

00:11:24.541 --> 00:11:26.416
I heard that he got suspended for 10 days.

00:11:27.166 --> 00:11:29.791
We're sending him to the
forest for ten days for research.

00:11:29.916 --> 00:11:30.458
To the forest?

00:11:30.833 --> 00:11:31.791
What kind of research ?

00:11:32.708 --> 00:11:36.540
He's going to the forest to find
out if monkeys have cholesterol.

00:11:36.541 --> 00:11:37.708
What's with all these new stories, mam?

00:11:37.875 --> 00:11:38.832
He is studying astrophysics, right?

00:11:38.833 --> 00:11:40.041
Don't ask him questions, ma'am.

00:11:40.291 --> 00:11:42.791
His nose weighs 0.75 Kg,
Do you think he doesn't have a brain?

00:11:43.041 --> 00:11:43.457
No, ma'am.

00:11:43.458 --> 00:11:44.208
He will do it well.

00:11:44.416 --> 00:11:46.791
If he causes any trouble there,
I'll beat him with my slipper.

00:11:47.041 --> 00:11:49.040
Idiot, what kind of a mother do you have?

00:11:49.041 --> 00:11:49.583
Get lost.

00:11:49.708 --> 00:11:50.708
What's this dear?

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:52.499
Mom, why did you talk
irrelevant things to madam?

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:53.583
Are you lying to your mother?

00:11:54.041 --> 00:11:54.791
Hey!!

00:11:55.166 --> 00:11:57.957
Now, you will talk to my dad
- Bahadur.
- What's with this guy?

00:11:57.958 --> 00:11:59.166
You talk to my dad, Bahadur.

00:11:59.291 --> 00:11:59.750
Hey!!

00:11:59.916 --> 00:12:01.708
I can't handle that and
we will easily get caught.

00:12:02.083 --> 00:12:03.166
atleast you talk to him.

00:12:04.958 --> 00:12:05.958
Guys, get lost.

00:12:06.208 --> 00:12:06.833
Oh, no!

00:12:07.041 --> 00:12:08.041
I'm already annoyed.

00:12:08.333 --> 00:12:09.333
I'm already annoyed.

00:12:09.583 --> 00:12:11.166
They'll use this as an
excuse to find me a groom.

00:12:11.458 --> 00:12:12.458
I don't know what to do now

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:13.583
Hi, bros.

00:12:13.791 --> 00:12:14.958
Watch him carefully,

00:12:15.208 --> 00:12:17.416
Because he has no
connection with this film,

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:19.041
He is not going to appear after this scene.

00:12:19.416 --> 00:12:23.083
But what he's about to reveal
is the turning point of this film.

00:12:23.625 --> 00:12:24.541
You don't have money.

00:12:24.875 --> 00:12:26.708
And you're not planning to
go home either, am I right?

00:12:26.916 --> 00:12:28.833
Bro, let us know if there's any other way.

00:12:29.375 --> 00:12:31.000
Bro, Is it possible for
you to talk to warden?

00:12:31.916 --> 00:12:32.958
Warden is not needed.

00:12:33.291 --> 00:12:35.291
If you want free food and accomodation,

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:36.582
For the next ten days.

00:12:36.583 --> 00:12:37.583
Go into the Black Hole.

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:38.583
Black Hole?

00:12:39.166 --> 00:12:40.958
There is a mad man named
Black Hole Padmanabhan.

00:12:41.416 --> 00:12:43.250
He is the supreme senior of our college.

00:12:43.625 --> 00:12:44.916
He belongs to the first batch of robotics.

00:12:45.041 --> 00:12:47.041
If any hostel student is in trouble,

00:12:47.208 --> 00:12:49.333
he'll jump in to help
without a second thought.

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:51.750
His house's name is Black Hole.

00:12:52.875 --> 00:12:53.625
Hello Boss,

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:54.375
A Good news,

00:12:54.541 --> 00:12:56.916
This time, we've got three
lab rats for our research.

00:12:57.375 --> 00:12:58.583
One of them is a female rat.

00:12:58.791 --> 00:12:59.583
What are you saying?

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:00.958
She might look a little like a boy.

00:13:01.458 --> 00:13:03.166
But she's definitely a girl.

00:13:03.916 --> 00:13:05.375
First time in my life,

00:13:05.958 --> 00:13:07.208
I'm going to use a girl for the research.

00:13:11.833 --> 00:13:12.583
Who are you guys?

00:13:13.166 --> 00:13:14.041
What is your problem?

00:13:14.208 --> 00:13:15.375
We didn't say anything.

00:13:15.541 --> 00:13:16.791
How did you find out we're in trouble?

00:13:18.958 --> 00:13:21.500
People don't come looking
for me unless they're in trouble.

00:13:22.041 --> 00:13:25.625
And once they come to me,
things won't end well for them.

00:13:25.916 --> 00:13:27.583
Anyway, lets keep my highlights aside.

00:13:27.708 --> 00:13:28.583
What is your problem?

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:31.458
All three of us got suspended
from the college, brother.

00:13:31.958 --> 00:13:34.666
We've been told that you
help those who come to you.

00:13:35.041 --> 00:13:36.083
That's why we came here.

00:13:37.375 --> 00:13:39.333
Yeah, why were you guys suspended?

00:13:41.291 --> 00:13:41.833
Wait.

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:43.208
I will tell.

00:13:44.458 --> 00:13:45.125
It's nothing, brother.

00:13:45.791 --> 00:13:46.791
Without the warden's permission,

00:13:46.916 --> 00:13:49.000
we climbed out of the hostel
and went to a late-night movie.

00:13:50.041 --> 00:13:51.083
It's nothing like what you think.

00:13:51.583 --> 00:13:52.791
To improve our knowledge,

00:13:52.916 --> 00:13:55.125
A movie called Interstellar
based on black hole.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:56.583
How is it?

00:14:05.333 --> 00:14:06.416
I have a lie detector.

00:14:06.666 --> 00:14:07.916
You better tell me the truth.

00:14:09.041 --> 00:14:10.458
We got caught by the police.

00:15:08.375 --> 00:15:09.624
Meow.

00:15:09.625 --> 00:15:09.958
Huh?

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:13.916
Welcome to Black Hole.

00:15:22.333 --> 00:15:23.125
What are you guys staring at?

00:15:23.416 --> 00:15:24.875
If you want to be part of this Black Hole,

00:15:25.416 --> 00:15:26.166
There are only two conditions.

00:15:26.458 --> 00:15:27.375
Condition number one.

00:15:27.833 --> 00:15:30.750
No matter what, you
shouldn't come into my lab.

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:32.457
Password protected.

00:15:32.458 --> 00:15:33.583
You can't do it anyway.

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:34.791
Condition number two.

00:15:35.416 --> 00:15:38.625
For one week, you must
not step out of this house.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.082
Even if you want to, you
won't be able to leave.

00:15:40.083 --> 00:15:43.125
Because, all the doors
will be under my control.

00:15:45.375 --> 00:15:46.125
Why is that? brother.

00:15:46.666 --> 00:15:47.708
Just for fun.

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:51.291
Even light can't escape a black hole.

00:15:51.625 --> 00:15:52.541
Do you think you can?

00:15:54.083 --> 00:15:54.708
So,

00:15:55.333 --> 00:15:56.875
If you are okay with these conditions,

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.000
You can stay here.

00:15:58.458 --> 00:16:00.000
If not, you can leave now.

00:16:00.416 --> 00:16:01.250
Let's go.

00:16:01.416 --> 00:16:01.708
Wait.

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:02.625
Brother,

00:16:02.916 --> 00:16:04.791
Anyways we need to step
out for buying food, right?

00:16:06.291 --> 00:16:07.208
You can get everything here.

00:16:07.458 --> 00:16:07.915
How, brother ?

00:16:07.916 --> 00:16:08.708
online order?

00:16:08.958 --> 00:16:09.291
Wait.

00:16:10.541 --> 00:16:11.208
Sampangi.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:15.000
Are they female cooks?

00:16:37.916 --> 00:16:39.541
Meet my buddy, Sampangi.

00:16:39.916 --> 00:16:41.333
I created this drone.

00:16:41.666 --> 00:16:42.666
Guys, say hi.

00:16:43.416 --> 00:16:44.416
Hiiiiii...

00:16:44.666 --> 00:16:45.166
Say it loudly.

00:16:45.458 --> 00:16:46.083
Hi.. Hi...

00:16:48.333 --> 00:16:49.791
Sampangi, scan these buggers.

00:16:50.166 --> 00:16:51.875
Scanning initiated.

00:16:55.666 --> 00:16:57.833
In this Black Hole, you can eat anything.

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.666
But, only 3 items are available.

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:01.833
Tea, Biriyani, Pani Puri.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:02.791
These are the code words.

00:17:03.458 --> 00:17:04.833
Tell your favourite dishes.

00:17:05.083 --> 00:17:06.250
Sampangi will go to the shop.

00:17:06.916 --> 00:17:08.249
They can hear you.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.000
You can place the order.

00:17:09.125 --> 00:17:09.750
Eat and enjoy.

00:17:11.333 --> 00:17:12.666
One more important thing.

00:17:14.791 --> 00:17:15.958
It's an automatic system.

00:17:17.666 --> 00:17:19.041
You can't operate it.

00:17:19.166 --> 00:17:20.083
Only voice command works.

00:17:20.333 --> 00:17:20.750
Okay?

00:17:22.208 --> 00:17:22.750
Enjoy.

00:17:23.083 --> 00:17:24.457
Have fun.
Relax and eat.

00:17:24.458 --> 00:17:25.333
I'll see you later.

00:17:25.583 --> 00:17:26.125
Sampangi,

00:17:26.708 --> 00:17:27.207
I'm going to take a shower.

00:17:27.208 --> 00:17:27.875
Get me a towel.

00:17:33.291 --> 00:17:34.041
It'll take a long time.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:35.833
Hey.

00:17:36.041 --> 00:17:36.416
Brother,

00:17:37.041 --> 00:17:37.791
Where did he go?

00:17:38.083 --> 00:17:38.625
I don't know.

00:17:40.208 --> 00:17:41.208
How did he go inside?

00:17:42.208 --> 00:17:44.333
Buddy, Look here.
The scientist is missing.

00:17:45.041 --> 00:17:45.625
Leave that.

00:17:46.208 --> 00:17:46.833
Look here.

00:17:47.791 --> 00:17:49.958
If this is the bathroom, how
are we supposed to use it?

00:17:51.333 --> 00:17:52.458
The place is good.

00:17:52.666 --> 00:17:53.916
But, it's weird, right?

00:17:55.416 --> 00:17:56.666
It's all because of him.

00:17:56.833 --> 00:17:57.625
Hey, Stop.

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:01.291
I feel this is better than our hostel.

00:18:02.166 --> 00:18:03.083
I'm going to stay here.

00:18:03.583 --> 00:18:04.500
Do whatever you want.

00:18:04.875 --> 00:18:05.500
Yes.

00:18:05.916 --> 00:18:06.750
Even I like this house.

00:18:07.375 --> 00:18:08.250
If you want, you can leave.

00:18:12.625 --> 00:18:13.415
It's okay.

00:18:13.416 --> 00:18:13.833
I'll stay here.

00:18:15.291 --> 00:18:15.500
Hey.

00:18:18.666 --> 00:18:21.208
It looks like we're trapped in
a madman's dream, doesn't it?

00:18:22.083 --> 00:18:23.791
Why does he have stairs there?

00:18:24.291 --> 00:18:25.541
I think he'll walk like this.

00:18:26.333 --> 00:18:26.958
Hey, quiet.

00:18:27.291 --> 00:18:29.166
I doubt he'll listen to us.

00:18:30.375 --> 00:18:32.583
What, another voice-over?
I can hear you think!

00:18:33.041 --> 00:18:34.666
But after this, I'll only
appear in the climax.

00:18:35.541 --> 00:18:37.833
But now, a song is going
to come out of nowhere!

00:18:38.583 --> 00:18:43.124
Because instead of showing how this
mad scientist manipulates these three

00:18:43.125 --> 00:18:44.791
in two separate scenes,

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:49.083
we can convey it briefly through a
song and get straight into the story.

00:18:50.916 --> 00:18:52.625
We can get out of here whenever we want.

00:18:57.291 --> 00:18:57.916
There's no chance, brother.

