00:21:50.458 --> 00:21:52.166
Did I wake up from the dream?

00:21:53.333 --> 00:21:54.791
Hey, buddy.

00:21:54.916 --> 00:21:55.375
Hey,

00:21:55.666 --> 00:21:56.333
Dush.

00:21:57.375 --> 00:21:57.958
Buddy,

00:21:58.500 --> 00:21:59.708
I woke up from that ghost dream.

00:22:00.916 --> 00:22:02.291
Buddy, I'd never sleepwalk!

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:05.915
What's with you man? talking about
sleepwalking and sleeping in the drainage!

00:22:05.916 --> 00:22:06.333
Go away.

00:22:07.375 --> 00:22:07.833
Get lost.

00:22:08.750 --> 00:22:10.333
Hey, Brownie.

00:22:11.791 --> 00:22:13.125
That foreign girl won't
show up in my dreams.

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:16.291
I came out of the dream, dear.

00:22:17.833 --> 00:22:18.375
Go.

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:20.375
Go marry that foreign girl.

00:22:21.833 --> 00:22:24.041
You don't love me because I'm dark, right?

00:22:26.250 --> 00:22:28.750
Do you know how much I love you?

00:22:35.458 --> 00:22:35.708
Yuck!

00:22:38.041 --> 00:22:38.916
Brownie is our friend.

00:22:40.375 --> 00:22:41.208
Don't think like that.

00:22:48.583 --> 00:22:49.625
Sampangi.

00:22:55.333 --> 00:22:56.875
What should I tell it now?

00:22:58.500 --> 00:22:59.958
Tea, coffee, biriyani.

00:23:00.666 --> 00:23:03.041
It has become an old fashion to eat
all these at midnight.

00:23:04.083 --> 00:23:04.875
I am getting bored.

00:23:06.166 --> 00:23:07.708
It will be good to eat a bun
butter jam.

00:23:08.125 --> 00:23:09.458
Password accepted.

00:23:13.208 --> 00:23:15.083
Manual mode activated.

00:23:15.833 --> 00:23:17.208
Manual mode activated?

00:23:24.333 --> 00:23:25.041
Looks like it is true.

00:23:25.458 --> 00:23:26.083
It is moving.

00:23:30.458 --> 00:23:30.750
Hey.

00:23:45.916 --> 00:23:46.625
Hey, look there.

00:23:46.833 --> 00:23:48.375
Sir, what is this?
Aliens !!

00:23:48.875 --> 00:23:49.875
Hey, stop.

00:23:50.041 --> 00:23:50.458
Hey, Alien !!

00:23:50.708 --> 00:23:51.583
He has escaped.

00:23:52.083 --> 00:23:52.416
Sir.

00:23:52.875 --> 00:23:54.541
What is this?
An exhaust fan is flying ?

00:25:35.791 --> 00:25:36.625
I love you.

00:25:37.625 --> 00:25:38.291
Thank you.

00:25:44.083 --> 00:25:47.958
(Whistles a tune)

00:25:51.666 --> 00:25:57.791
(Whistles a tune)

00:26:01.000 --> 00:26:04.291
(Whistles a tune)

00:27:51.791 --> 00:27:52.625
O Moon...

00:27:55.375 --> 00:27:56.375
I love you, Kish.

00:27:57.000 --> 00:27:58.583
Do you know how much I miss you?

00:27:59.708 --> 00:28:01.666
I'm waiting for the day
you'll propose to me

00:28:02.708 --> 00:28:04.250
This diary is filled with
memories of your only.

00:28:05.000 --> 00:28:06.708
Oh, No...

00:28:10.375 --> 00:28:10.666
Hey.

00:28:11.541 --> 00:28:13.375
I am starving.
Shall we eat?

00:28:13.958 --> 00:28:14.875
I don't want anything, buddy.

00:28:15.958 --> 00:28:17.000
Hey, what about you?

00:28:17.416 --> 00:28:18.166
I don't want.

00:28:18.958 --> 00:28:21.916
What on earth are they doing in here?

00:28:23.291 --> 00:28:24.291
Hey, Sampangi.

00:28:31.791 --> 00:28:32.916
Only one biriyani.

00:28:33.833 --> 00:28:34.833
For me only.

00:28:35.291 --> 00:28:37.958
If anyone lays a hand on that biryani,
I'll bite your hand off!

00:28:38.791 --> 00:28:39.458
GO!!

00:28:46.833 --> 00:28:48.458
Are we looking at your exam paper?

00:28:48.958 --> 00:28:49.916
Why do you have to hide it ?

00:28:50.500 --> 00:28:52.166
What are you writing to keep it discreet?

00:28:52.708 --> 00:28:54.500
I can't say that, you moron!

00:28:54.666 --> 00:28:55.458
You can't say?

00:28:56.250 --> 00:28:57.041
Hey, Rush.

00:28:57.458 --> 00:28:58.458
Come. Let's attack him.

00:28:59.166 --> 00:29:00.750
Buddy, listen to me.
No. Hey, look here.

00:29:00.875 --> 00:29:01.666
Hey..Hey...

00:29:05.166 --> 00:29:05.666
Buddy.

00:29:06.583 --> 00:29:07.082
Listen to me.

00:29:07.083 --> 00:29:08.125
Oh moon...

00:29:08.500 --> 00:29:11.291
Oh, Moon, why are there
so many pits on your face?

00:29:12.000 --> 00:29:14.416
Oh, are those dimples?

00:29:16.458 --> 00:29:18.333
Is this what you've been
hyping up all this while?

00:29:19.583 --> 00:29:20.583
Who did he write about?

00:29:21.583 --> 00:29:22.500
Hey, it's nothing, dear.

00:29:22.708 --> 00:29:23.708
Whose dimples?

00:29:27.791 --> 00:29:29.291
This weird-nosed guy is feeling shy!

00:29:29.458 --> 00:29:30.291
Hey, just tell it.

00:29:30.541 --> 00:29:30.875
Hey.

00:29:31.333 --> 00:29:32.458
Hey, It's nothing, Brownie.

00:29:32.791 --> 00:29:34.083
I was just trying to write a poem.

00:29:34.250 --> 00:29:34.583
That's all.

00:29:36.000 --> 00:29:38.208
They're called dimples
only if there are two of them.

00:29:38.791 --> 00:29:41.375
If they're all over the
face, it's chickenpox.

00:29:41.583 --> 00:29:42.125
You shut up.

00:29:42.666 --> 00:29:43.125
You tell me.

00:29:43.666 --> 00:29:45.208
It's nothing to get angry about, okay?

00:29:46.583 --> 00:29:47.125
It's like...

00:29:47.833 --> 00:29:49.916
If you tell a girl that
another girl is beautiful...

00:29:51.583 --> 00:29:52.583
I thought you'd feel bad!

00:29:52.708 --> 00:29:52.916
No.

00:29:53.750 --> 00:29:54.291
I am not like that.

00:29:55.666 --> 00:29:57.375
When did even see her as a girl?

00:29:57.833 --> 00:29:58.291
Shut up.

00:29:58.791 --> 00:29:59.166
You tell me.

00:30:00.291 --> 00:30:01.416
I don't know her name.

00:30:02.291 --> 00:30:03.166
But if she smiles,

00:30:04.375 --> 00:30:05.750
she will have beautiful dimples.

00:30:06.875 --> 00:30:08.083
It will be so bright,

00:30:09.250 --> 00:30:11.375
Like a moon on a full moon day.

00:30:12.000 --> 00:30:13.625
Like in the fantasy tales,

00:30:14.625 --> 00:30:15.000
An angel.

00:30:15.791 --> 00:30:16.791
She will look like an angel.

00:30:17.083 --> 00:30:18.958
Like a fairytale princess.

00:30:20.458 --> 00:30:23.208
Why are all fairy-tale
princesses fair-skinned?

00:30:23.666 --> 00:30:25.166
Because the writers are men.

00:30:25.500 --> 00:30:26.333
That's how we write.

00:30:26.541 --> 00:30:28.208
"A dark beautiful girl "

00:30:28.583 --> 00:30:29.624
Have you seen anyone saying like that?

00:30:29.625 --> 00:30:30.250
Hey, shut up.

00:30:30.375 --> 00:30:31.541
Hey, Brownie.

00:30:33.125 --> 00:30:34.916
If you call me Brownie one
more time, you're done for!

00:30:42.791 --> 00:30:45.791
He is just a friend to you, that's all.

00:30:50.375 --> 00:30:51.583
Who he loves,

00:30:52.791 --> 00:30:53.500
Why do you care?

00:30:54.458 --> 00:30:55.541
Aren't you ashamed?

00:30:59.458 --> 00:31:01.208
For your inferiority complex,

00:31:02.416 --> 00:31:03.416
He is just a villain.

00:31:04.416 --> 00:31:05.416
Okay?

00:31:09.125 --> 00:31:09.500
Go,

00:31:11.916 --> 00:31:13.000
Go and apologize.

00:31:16.000 --> 00:31:17.000
Go and apologize.

00:31:29.208 --> 00:31:30.375
Come..come.. come and stand here.

00:31:30.666 --> 00:31:31.166
Kooma sir.

00:31:32.500 --> 00:31:32.916
Sir.

00:31:33.875 --> 00:31:35.958
Somehow, I got the parrot
astrologer's friend to come here.

00:31:36.583 --> 00:31:37.791
He's a palmist.

00:31:38.208 --> 00:31:38.875
Hey,

00:31:39.250 --> 00:31:41.166
Didn't I ask you to find the
killer and bring him here?

00:31:41.666 --> 00:31:43.375
But you've brought me the next victim!

00:31:43.666 --> 00:31:44.250
Shiva..Shiva...

00:31:44.583 --> 00:31:44.958
Sir.

00:31:45.166 --> 00:31:46.166
Give me your hand,

00:31:46.541 --> 00:31:47.541
That's my plan.

00:31:48.083 --> 00:31:48.500
Hey,

00:31:48.833 --> 00:31:49.457
Shut up.

00:31:49.458 --> 00:31:50.958
As if you're going to save the nation
just by staying alive!

00:31:51.458 --> 00:31:51.833
Sir.

00:31:52.375 --> 00:31:54.583
When the incident happened,
he was there with him too.

00:31:55.250 --> 00:31:57.333
So, the killer followed him too.

00:31:57.958 --> 00:32:00.958
What if he is the next
target of the killer?

00:32:01.416 --> 00:32:02.708
We can use him,

00:32:03.208 --> 00:32:04.333
To catch that killer.

00:32:07.500 --> 00:32:08.291
What is your name?

00:32:08.500 --> 00:32:09.208
Kaiko sir.

00:32:09.333 --> 00:32:10.333
What? Psycho?

00:32:10.583 --> 00:32:11.208
Kaiko sir.

00:32:11.500 --> 00:32:12.458
Kairegai Govindhan.

00:32:12.750 --> 00:32:14.833
Won't you tell me your full name first?

00:32:15.125 --> 00:32:16.582
Why do we always get guys like him?

00:32:16.583 --> 00:32:17.000
Why buddy?

00:32:17.333 --> 00:32:18.750
Three people came here before him, right?

00:32:19.166 --> 00:32:21.083
Dash, Bush, Kish...

00:32:21.458 --> 00:32:22.791
Apologies, Sir.

00:32:22.916 --> 00:32:24.541
People know me as Kaiko.

00:32:24.791 --> 00:32:25.791
Oh...

00:32:26.041 --> 00:32:27.416
So, you are a famous astrologer?

00:32:28.208 --> 00:32:29.208
Shall we check it?

00:32:29.875 --> 00:32:32.166
Alright, tell me when I got married.

00:32:33.666 --> 00:32:34.541
Brother, hold this for a minute.

00:32:35.625 --> 00:32:35.833
Hey!

00:32:42.416 --> 00:32:43.833
Oh, No. Very dangerous.

00:32:44.250 --> 00:32:45.291
Sir is not married yet.

00:32:45.625 --> 00:32:47.791
Have you ever proposed to any girl?

00:32:49.333 --> 00:32:52.540
Even though I'm a policeman,
I don't have that kind of courage.

00:32:52.541 --> 00:32:54.208
Please don't do it.

00:32:54.625 --> 00:32:55.000
Why?

00:32:55.416 --> 00:32:57.083
You have a rare virgin dhosham.

00:32:57.500 --> 00:32:59.166
If you express your love to any girl,

00:32:59.375 --> 00:33:00.458
The next moment,

00:33:00.916 --> 00:33:01.708
she will die.

00:33:02.041 --> 00:33:03.041
Die?

00:33:03.791 --> 00:33:04.791
One minute.

00:33:07.208 --> 00:33:09.124
How dare you tell him
everything and bring him here?

00:33:09.125 --> 00:33:09.750
Satan.

00:33:10.083 --> 00:33:11.833
Hey, palmist, did I tell you any
details before bringing you here?

00:33:12.166 --> 00:33:13.416
Sir, there is no need
for anyone to tell me.

00:33:13.833 --> 00:33:14.875
Your palm says it all.

00:33:16.083 --> 00:33:16.458
Yeah, right.

00:33:16.916 --> 00:33:17.916
Shall we check it?

00:33:21.625 --> 00:33:22.625
Oh, No.

00:33:23.166 --> 00:33:24.458
Sangeetha, run.. run...

00:33:24.791 --> 00:33:25.583
Sangeetha.

00:33:26.166 --> 00:33:26.833
I love you.

00:33:27.916 --> 00:33:29.541
Go away, sir. I've had
enough of your games.

00:33:30.208 --> 00:33:31.916
I am getting married next week.

00:33:33.541 --> 00:33:34.082
See.

00:33:34.083 --> 00:33:34.875
Nothing happened.

00:33:36.958 --> 00:33:38.375
Sir, don't doubt my prophecy.

00:33:38.791 --> 00:33:41.833
The moment you express your love
to a girl from the bottom of your heart,

00:33:42.041 --> 00:33:43.708
I swear on God, that girl will die.

00:33:44.166 --> 00:33:44.916
Shiva ..Shiva...

00:33:48.291 --> 00:33:49.583
Hey, super, buddy.

00:33:49.875 --> 00:33:51.500
How did you find the password?

00:33:51.750 --> 00:33:52.625
I didn't find it.

00:33:53.041 --> 00:33:54.791
I just said "Bun, butter,
jam" it got unlocked.

00:33:55.333 --> 00:33:56.166
Let it be.

00:33:56.333 --> 00:33:57.541
Where is your dimple girl?

00:33:57.791 --> 00:33:58.666
Show me her house.

00:33:58.791 --> 00:33:59.375
I want to see it.

00:34:00.208 --> 00:34:01.041
How can I ?

00:34:01.708 --> 00:34:03.083
Is this a road map to remember?

00:34:04.625 --> 00:34:05.625
I wandered all over the place.

00:34:07.041 --> 00:34:07.958
I was flying in the sky.

00:34:09.333 --> 00:34:10.041
Then I missed it.

00:34:12.208 --> 00:34:14.125
After then i tried three times,

00:34:15.458 --> 00:34:16.625
I couldn't track the route.

00:34:18.333 --> 00:34:20.041
But she's always in my memory.

00:34:22.625 --> 00:34:24.166
Did you know I wrote poems for her?

00:34:26.875 --> 00:34:28.083
Are you a fool?

00:34:28.541 --> 00:34:29.875
There will be travel
history for the drone, right?

00:34:30.083 --> 00:34:30.875
Did you check it?

00:34:31.250 --> 00:34:31.625
No, right?

00:34:41.208 --> 00:34:42.458
Hey, that's the place.

00:35:03.125 --> 00:35:03.958
What is all this?

00:35:04.416 --> 00:35:04.916
I don't know.

00:35:10.416 --> 00:35:12.041
Hey, you're back again?

00:35:13.916 --> 00:35:14.708
Hi.

00:35:16.041 --> 00:35:16.625
Hello.

00:35:18.250 --> 00:35:19.250
Come closer.

00:35:20.041 --> 00:35:20.416
Wow...

00:35:27.750 --> 00:35:28.208
Hey.

00:35:28.583 --> 00:35:29.583
Isn't she beautiful?

00:35:29.875 --> 00:35:31.125
What is your name?

00:35:31.750 --> 00:35:32.916
My name is Kishore.

00:35:35.458 --> 00:35:36.750
My name is Kishore.

00:35:37.291 --> 00:35:38.000
What is your name?

00:35:38.458 --> 00:35:39.041
Prakruthi.

00:35:40.333 --> 00:35:41.083
What are you doing?

00:35:41.958 --> 00:35:42.750
Did you eat?

00:35:43.250 --> 00:35:44.458
Are you a food delivery boy?

00:35:44.666 --> 00:35:46.375
No, I am not a delivery boy.

00:35:47.083 --> 00:35:48.500
I am doing M.Sc. in Astrophysics.

00:35:49.083 --> 00:35:49.625
Final year.

00:35:50.833 --> 00:35:52.708
I am a miniature artist.

00:35:54.250 --> 00:35:54.833
I saw.

00:35:55.500 --> 00:35:57.583
Everything is small and beautiful.

00:35:58.083 --> 00:35:58.791
Just like you.

00:35:58.958 --> 00:35:59.375
Oh no.

00:36:00.583 --> 00:36:02.458
I think my grandma is here.

00:36:02.833 --> 00:36:03.333
Grandma?

00:36:03.541 --> 00:36:03.916
Leave.

00:36:04.583 --> 00:36:05.916
Is she afraid of her grand mother?

00:36:07.625 --> 00:36:08.290
Go, go, go.

00:36:08.291 --> 00:36:08.957
Okay, okay.

00:36:08.958 --> 00:36:09.708
Bye, bye.

00:36:09.916 --> 00:36:10.375
See you.

00:37:27.875 --> 00:37:29.458
Did you decide that she is your soulmate?

00:37:33.708 --> 00:37:35.083
The moment I saw her on the drone,

00:37:36.333 --> 00:37:37.333
My decision was made.

00:37:39.041 --> 00:37:40.458
I was scared that I would lose her.

00:37:42.333 --> 00:37:43.375
Thank you, my darling.

00:37:45.208 --> 00:37:46.333
I got her back only because of you.

00:38:03.416 --> 00:38:05.166
What could be the password?

00:38:05.875 --> 00:38:06.875
Let me press something.

00:38:09.833 --> 00:38:11.125
Access granted.

00:38:34.666 --> 00:38:37.000
Oxygen level 98% ?

00:38:40.875 --> 00:38:41.458
Oh no.

00:38:44.500 --> 00:38:45.291
Scientist brother!

00:38:45.875 --> 00:38:46.791
Scientist brother!

00:38:47.541 --> 00:38:48.416
Kish Buddy!!

00:38:48.958 --> 00:38:49.583
Rush!

00:38:49.875 --> 00:38:50.208
Hey!

00:38:50.916 --> 00:38:52.458
Scientist bro! Open it! bro!

00:38:52.791 --> 00:38:53.625
Open it bro!

00:38:55.000 --> 00:38:55.625
Bro!

00:39:02.500 --> 00:39:04.041
Someone please save me!

00:39:05.500 --> 00:39:06.500
Scientist brother!

00:39:08.791 --> 00:39:10.291
I'm scared, brother!

00:39:46.125 --> 00:39:47.125
I'm scared, brother!

00:39:51.833 --> 00:39:55.500
(extreme noise)

00:40:10.375 --> 00:40:11.208
Buddy.

00:40:11.666 --> 00:40:13.750
I'm scared, please save me brother.

00:40:13.875 --> 00:40:16.125
I don't know where the way is!

00:40:16.500 --> 00:40:17.958
Someone please save me!

00:40:19.791 --> 00:40:20.291
Bro !

00:40:20.750 --> 00:40:21.875
Bro, Save me bro!

00:40:25.125 --> 00:40:26.375
I'm suffocating!

00:40:27.000 --> 00:40:27.958
I'm suffocating!

00:40:28.916 --> 00:40:29.791
I can't run!

00:40:30.041 --> 00:40:31.333
I'm scared, brother!

00:40:31.916 --> 00:40:33.083
Save me, brother!

00:40:33.750 --> 00:40:34.958
How do I get out?

00:40:35.416 --> 00:40:36.000
There's no way!

00:40:36.375 --> 00:40:37.666
Way... I have to get out!

00:40:38.166 --> 00:40:38.833
I have to get out.

00:40:39.291 --> 00:40:39.791
Out...

00:40:40.291 --> 00:40:41.416
Hey, Scientist !!

00:41:06.833 --> 00:41:07.500
Save me!

00:41:07.833 --> 00:41:08.333
I can't tolerate!

00:41:08.666 --> 00:41:09.291
Save me!

00:41:24.333 --> 00:41:24.750
Dush!

00:41:25.041 --> 00:41:27.083
You've come out!
Don't be scared!

00:41:27.750 --> 00:41:28.291
What?

00:41:29.000 --> 00:41:30.416
Dialling some random numbers,

00:41:31.000 --> 00:41:32.541
You thought you could get into my lab?

00:41:33.166 --> 00:41:35.916
It's a trap I set for people like
you who come here and stay.

00:41:39.166 --> 00:41:41.583
Any number you dialed
would've opened the door.

00:41:46.916 --> 00:41:48.583
Do you know it's real password?

00:41:51.000 --> 00:41:51.708
It's you guys.

00:41:53.750 --> 00:41:57.541
It's about reaching the center of
the maze before the oxygen runs out

00:42:00.958 --> 00:42:02.125
Do you want to try it one more time?

00:42:03.125 --> 00:42:03.458
No.

00:42:04.041 --> 00:42:04.791
No.

00:42:16.583 --> 00:42:19.666
It's better if you keep to
yourself, eat, and leave.

00:42:20.208 --> 00:42:22.500
If you break the rules unnecessarily...

00:42:37.375 --> 00:42:38.250
4 o'clock.

00:42:38.416 --> 00:42:39.000
Jogging time.

00:42:53.708 --> 00:42:54.583
Who is this guy?

00:43:00.166 --> 00:43:02.666
No matter how much you suffer,
don't you ever learn?

00:43:03.416 --> 00:43:04.583
Don't start this first
thing in the morning.

00:43:15.541 --> 00:43:17.333
What you thought won't happen.

00:43:17.791 --> 00:43:18.791
Let me be in peace.

00:43:24.041 --> 00:43:26.291
Don't get your hopes up.

00:43:26.791 --> 00:43:27.791
Don't trust him.

00:43:28.541 --> 00:43:30.416
He's no different from other men.

00:43:33.125 --> 00:43:34.958
He will come back.
He will come back for me.

00:43:37.250 --> 00:43:39.875
How can he come back?
I won't let him come.

00:43:40.791 --> 00:43:43.458
If he comes, I will kill him.

00:43:46.375 --> 00:43:47.708
Do whatever you want.

00:43:47.916 --> 00:43:48.916
I like him.

00:43:49.125 --> 00:43:50.125
You like him?

00:43:50.541 --> 00:43:51.916
What do you like?

00:43:53.875 --> 00:43:54.291
Leave me.

00:43:56.666 --> 00:43:57.666
Why are you doing like this?

00:43:57.833 --> 00:43:59.666
I won't leave you until
you learn your lesson.

00:43:59.791 --> 00:44:02.415
Instead of torturing me like this,
You better kill me.

00:44:02.416 --> 00:44:04.208
I'll do that too.

00:44:06.333 --> 00:44:09.041
Drawn to you like gravity to Earth,

00:44:09.708 --> 00:44:12.458
Like the speed of a colliding force,

00:44:13.541 --> 00:44:15.500
My heart lost its balance

00:44:17.166 --> 00:44:19.541
and got trapped in your dimples.

00:44:28.458 --> 00:44:29.458
Sampangi,

00:44:32.000 --> 00:44:32.875
Shall we go?

00:44:47.416 --> 00:44:47.833
Hello...

00:44:48.166 --> 00:44:49.708
Hello, why did you make such a decision?

00:44:50.083 --> 00:44:51.083
Please get down.

00:44:51.541 --> 00:44:52.458
Tell me what the problem is.

00:44:53.125 --> 00:44:54.166
We can solve it.

00:44:56.166 --> 00:44:57.208
I don't like to live.

00:44:58.333 --> 00:44:59.291
Don't disturb me.

00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:01.250
I am there for you.

00:45:02.333 --> 00:45:04.625
I'll be a good friend
for the rest of your life.

00:45:04.875 --> 00:45:05.625
Please believe me.

00:45:06.000 --> 00:45:07.166
I don't know who you are.

00:45:07.916 --> 00:45:08.833
I have never even seen you.

00:45:09.833 --> 00:45:11.125
Why do you care about me?

00:45:11.875 --> 00:45:12.958
Who are you to save me ?

00:45:14.208 --> 00:45:15.208
I am going to die.

00:45:15.625 --> 00:45:16.708
Emergency alert.

00:45:17.208 --> 00:45:18.125
Battery low.

00:45:18.625 --> 00:45:18.916
Hey!

00:45:20.750 --> 00:45:21.833
I love you, dear.

00:45:24.416 --> 00:45:25.125
What did you say?

00:45:27.291 --> 00:45:28.041
You heard me, right?

00:45:28.791 --> 00:45:29.125
That's it.

00:45:29.916 --> 00:45:30.625
I need you.

00:45:31.416 --> 00:45:32.541
I will do anything for you.

00:45:33.500 --> 00:45:34.333
I will give my life.

00:45:35.708 --> 00:45:37.208
I couldn't see you for just one day,

00:45:37.916 --> 00:45:38.791
that was unbearable for me.

00:45:39.583 --> 00:45:40.833
I wanted to see you again.

00:45:42.958 --> 00:45:44.625
If you leave me for the rest of my life,

00:45:47.708 --> 00:45:49.375
I swear, I will go mad.

00:45:51.916 --> 00:45:52.708
Not only that,

00:45:53.000 --> 00:45:54.208
I never knew I'd love you this much.

00:45:55.416 --> 00:45:56.416
Not just you.

00:45:57.958 --> 00:45:59.208
even I realized it only now.

00:46:00.666 --> 00:46:01.333
Don't go.

00:46:02.083 --> 00:46:02.416
Please.

00:46:03.583 --> 00:46:04.666
Returning to dock.

00:46:06.291 --> 00:46:06.916
I have to go now.

00:46:08.416 --> 00:46:09.541
Just don't get yourself killed.

00:46:10.583 --> 00:46:11.041
Please.

00:46:11.666 --> 00:46:12.416
Promise me.

00:46:14.708 --> 00:46:15.583
Promise me, dear.

00:46:17.625 --> 00:46:18.375
Do it.

00:46:23.250 --> 00:46:23.750
Promise.

00:46:24.750 --> 00:46:25.458
Override.

00:46:25.625 --> 00:46:26.416
Manual mode.

00:46:27.000 --> 00:46:27.666
I will come back.

00:46:29.125 --> 00:46:29.750
I will come back.

00:46:30.416 --> 00:46:31.041
I will definitely come back.

00:46:31.791 --> 00:46:32.125
Bye.

00:46:50.083 --> 00:46:50.750
Rasa.

00:46:51.041 --> 00:46:52.458
All your feelings are fine,

00:46:52.625 --> 00:46:53.875
But how will you get out of here?

00:46:54.041 --> 00:46:54.291
Hey!

00:46:54.791 --> 00:46:55.750
No one asked you for logic.

00:46:55.916 --> 00:46:56.833
If you can help, do it.

00:46:57.041 --> 00:46:59.208
If I knew that, I would
have gone out, right?

00:46:59.708 --> 00:47:01.791
Kish, just four more days.
Hang in there.

00:47:02.125 --> 00:47:02.333
Hey!

00:47:02.833 --> 00:47:04.083
If she dies, can you bring her back?

00:47:04.291 --> 00:47:05.250
Will you bring her back?

00:47:08.041 --> 00:47:08.666
What do you care?

00:47:09.500 --> 00:47:10.875
If she dies, you will be happy.

00:47:14.750 --> 00:47:15.416
What did you say?

00:47:16.333 --> 00:47:17.000
No, sorry.

00:47:17.166 --> 00:47:18.125
Out of anger...

00:47:18.333 --> 00:47:18.583
Hey!

00:47:19.916 --> 00:47:20.375
Hey!

00:47:21.291 --> 00:47:23.250
What is happening here?
Why did you hit him?

00:47:23.833 --> 00:47:25.291
Do I look so cheap to you?

00:47:25.583 --> 00:47:25.833
Huh?

00:47:26.291 --> 00:47:28.458
I trusted you guys enough
to come and stay here with you.

00:47:28.916 --> 00:47:30.708
If the college finds out,
do you know what they'll call me?

00:47:31.375 --> 00:47:33.333
But still, I came here for you.

00:47:33.958 --> 00:47:35.708
When I came to know
that you love someone else,

00:47:36.083 --> 00:47:38.250
I gave up everything and
staying here as your friend.

00:47:38.833 --> 00:47:40.416
How can you do this to me?

00:47:42.000 --> 00:47:42.500
Brownie.

00:47:43.416 --> 00:47:44.333
Hey, Brownie.

00:47:45.000 --> 00:47:45.832
Hey, hey.

00:47:45.833 --> 00:47:46.333
I am sorry.

00:47:46.625 --> 00:47:47.166
Look here.

00:47:47.875 --> 00:47:48.958
I said this out of anger.

00:47:49.250 --> 00:47:49.958
I am sorry.

00:47:50.125 --> 00:47:50.665
Look here.

00:47:50.666 --> 00:47:51.500
Please, please, please.

00:47:51.625 --> 00:47:52.083
Don't cry.

00:47:52.291 --> 00:47:52.749
Don't cry.

00:47:52.750 --> 00:47:53.290
Please.

00:47:53.291 --> 00:47:53.999
Look here.

00:47:54.000 --> 00:47:54.833
I said this out of anger.

00:47:55.041 --> 00:47:55.875
I didn't mean it.

00:48:00.458 --> 00:48:01.208
Don't cry.

00:48:01.333 --> 00:48:02.499
Okay, okay, okay.

00:48:02.500 --> 00:48:03.666
- Okay.
- Okay...

00:48:03.833 --> 00:48:04.083
Okay.

00:48:04.500 --> 00:48:05.541
Look here.
Look here.

00:48:05.750 --> 00:48:07.250
Okay, okay, okay.

00:48:07.583 --> 00:48:09.416
Calm down.. calm down...

00:48:09.708 --> 00:48:10.041
Hey!

00:48:11.208 --> 00:48:13.625
How do I look to you guys?
Won't you say anything to me?

00:48:14.125 --> 00:48:15.916
Hey, spring head. When did you love him?

00:48:29.416 --> 00:48:30.125
Sampangi.

00:48:35.166 --> 00:48:36.333
My head is getting hot.

00:48:36.916 --> 00:48:38.333
Go get me a monkey tonic.

00:48:39.750 --> 00:48:40.166
What?

00:48:41.500 --> 00:48:42.625
Shall we eat biriyani?

00:48:44.958 --> 00:48:45.541
Hey!

00:48:45.666 --> 00:48:46.916
Look at it leaving.
I'm not done yet!

00:48:47.666 --> 00:48:48.416
Stupid.

00:48:56.625 --> 00:48:57.958
There is a way for you to get out.

00:48:59.750 --> 00:49:01.541
Hey, why is it so dark in here?

00:49:01.833 --> 00:49:02.916
I'm not coming.

00:49:03.875 --> 00:49:04.166
Get lost.

00:49:04.458 --> 00:49:05.083
Kish, you come.

00:49:10.250 --> 00:49:11.708
Buddy, stay here and keep watch.

00:49:17.750 --> 00:49:20.333
I'd rather go with these guys
than be stuck in this house.

00:49:27.416 --> 00:49:28.708
Kish, come fast.

00:49:37.958 --> 00:49:38.791
Come, buddy.

00:49:49.625 --> 00:49:51.083
If there's enough gap
to fly a drone through,

00:49:51.666 --> 00:49:52.625
You can definitely go.

00:49:54.083 --> 00:49:54.791
Inside this?

00:49:55.000 --> 00:49:55.458
Yes.

00:49:57.166 --> 00:49:59.125
If you want those dimples,
you'll have to go into this hole too.

00:49:59.916 --> 00:50:00.541
Go.

00:50:09.625 --> 00:50:10.125
Hey,

00:50:11.083 --> 00:50:13.333
I hope you didn't give him this idea
to take revenge on him.

00:50:14.541 --> 00:50:14.958
Why?

00:50:15.333 --> 00:50:17.583
If the drone doesn't
come out in half an hour,

00:50:17.708 --> 00:50:20.083
That means he's stuck somewhere inside.

00:50:51.958 --> 00:50:52.958
You need Qr code sir?

00:50:56.208 --> 00:50:57.250
- Thank you.
- Ok, thank you, sir.

00:51:24.125 --> 00:51:25.125
Prakruthi.

00:51:36.333 --> 00:51:37.166
Prakruthi.

00:51:40.291 --> 00:51:40.875
Prakruthi.

00:51:42.958 --> 00:51:43.541
Are you there?

00:51:52.208 --> 00:51:52.833
Kish.

00:51:54.000 --> 00:51:54.958
Kish, you've arrived?

00:51:55.166 --> 00:51:55.541
Hi.

00:51:56.500 --> 00:51:57.000
I'm here.

00:51:57.708 --> 00:51:58.625
I'm upstairs.

00:51:58.916 --> 00:51:59.583
Come up.

00:52:00.041 --> 00:52:00.708
I'm coming.

00:52:42.458 --> 00:52:43.166
Prakruthi.

00:52:44.750 --> 00:52:45.375
Prakruthi.

00:52:54.375 --> 00:52:55.208
It's me, Kishore.

00:52:56.333 --> 00:52:57.291
I came in through the drone.

00:52:59.750 --> 00:53:03.208
You're so brave to come to a
girl's house in the middle of the night.

00:53:04.625 --> 00:53:06.125
Compared to the courage
to commit suicide,

00:53:06.583 --> 00:53:07.583
This is far better.

00:53:11.208 --> 00:53:11.791
Listen,

00:53:12.291 --> 00:53:13.791
It's all fine that you saved me.

00:53:14.375 --> 00:53:16.583
But this thing between us — it won't work.

00:53:17.208 --> 00:53:18.083
Why won't it work?

00:53:19.166 --> 00:53:20.750
You don't know my grandma.

00:53:22.666 --> 00:53:23.916
She's very dangerous.

00:53:24.833 --> 00:53:25.041
Hey.

00:53:25.833 --> 00:53:27.166
Why are you scared of an old lady?

00:53:27.958 --> 00:53:29.083
I'll talk to her and make her understand.

00:53:30.583 --> 00:53:32.041
First, tell me — do you love me or not?

00:53:32.458 --> 00:53:33.125
Just tell me that.

00:53:35.583 --> 00:53:36.791
This is the first time
you've come to see me.

00:53:37.333 --> 00:53:39.666
would you come empty-handed like this?

00:53:40.458 --> 00:53:40.833
No.

00:53:42.083 --> 00:53:44.333
It's night — the shops are all closed.

00:53:46.250 --> 00:53:48.250
If they were open, what would you buy me?

00:53:48.791 --> 00:53:49.666
I will buy anything.

00:53:51.250 --> 00:53:54.666
I want a doll and a ring.

00:53:55.291 --> 00:53:55.958
That's all?

00:53:56.416 --> 00:53:56.791
Yes.

00:53:58.500 --> 00:53:58.875
Huh?

00:53:59.583 --> 00:53:59.958
No.

00:54:00.833 --> 00:54:01.458
Not this.

00:54:01.833 --> 00:54:03.416
I want a special ring.

00:54:04.666 --> 00:54:06.375
You have to properly propose to me.

00:54:07.041 --> 00:54:09.583
After that, if you're still alive...

00:54:10.333 --> 00:54:11.083
Then,

00:54:11.625 --> 00:54:12.625
We can romance.

00:54:15.541 --> 00:54:16.625
I will be alive.

00:54:18.625 --> 00:54:19.791
You stay alive till then.

00:54:23.791 --> 00:54:25.291
How can you love me this much?

00:54:26.916 --> 00:54:27.541
I don't know.

00:54:28.583 --> 00:54:29.708
I felt it the moment I saw you.

00:54:30.833 --> 00:54:32.166
I just knew you were my soulmate.

00:54:34.625 --> 00:54:37.333
Roughly, How long will you love me?

00:54:37.875 --> 00:54:38.166
Hey.

00:54:39.208 --> 00:54:40.208
What kind of question is that?

00:54:41.166 --> 00:54:42.458
Love is eternal.

00:54:43.333 --> 00:54:44.458
I will always love you.

00:54:45.541 --> 00:54:46.166
Forget all that.

00:54:47.541 --> 00:54:48.583
You like me, right?

00:54:52.375 --> 00:54:53.250
If I didn't like you,

00:54:54.375 --> 00:54:55.708
why would I have pulled you inside?

00:54:57.416 --> 00:54:58.250
Ya, right.

00:54:59.958 --> 00:55:01.541
I still can't believe it.

00:55:03.333 --> 00:55:04.708
Seeing you this close,

00:55:05.083 --> 00:55:06.416
I never thought about it.

00:55:07.083 --> 00:55:07.791
Thanks.

00:55:08.708 --> 00:55:09.166
For what?

00:55:10.083 --> 00:55:10.375
For,

00:55:11.583 --> 00:55:12.666
I'm just an ordinary guy.

00:55:13.875 --> 00:55:16.250
You look like an angel from a fairy tale.

00:55:17.166 --> 00:55:19.208
If you saw me in person, you'd say no,

00:55:20.166 --> 00:55:20.666
I was afraid.

00:55:25.833 --> 00:55:27.666
I'm not the kind of girl
who falls for looks.

00:55:32.041 --> 00:55:33.750
This skin will wrinkle one day.

00:55:35.291 --> 00:55:36.708
My hair will turn gray one day.

00:55:37.833 --> 00:55:39.375
My beauty will fade one day.

00:55:42.750 --> 00:55:44.333
Will you still love me after all that?

00:55:44.916 --> 00:55:45.750
Definitely.

00:55:46.583 --> 00:55:47.291
Without a doubt.

00:55:49.666 --> 00:55:50.333
Promise?

00:55:52.500 --> 00:55:53.208
I swear on my mother.

00:55:59.458 --> 00:56:01.333
♪ I'm your king, my love! ♪

00:56:02.166 --> 00:56:04.083
♪ You're my queen, my love! ♪

00:56:04.666 --> 00:56:09.333
♪ Will the day ever come When you
make me your toy and play with me? ♪

00:56:09.500 --> 00:56:14.083
♪ My head is spinning, spinning, spinning!
♪ ♪ Everything I see feels like a dream! ♪

00:56:14.208 --> 00:56:19.416
- ♪ Why is my heart racing, racing?
- My
desires have multiplied a hundredfold! ♪

00:56:19.750 --> 00:56:24.500
♪ My head is spinning, spinning, spinning!
♪ ♪ Everything I see feels like a dream! ♪

00:56:24.666 --> 00:56:29.875
- ♪ Why is my heart racing, racing?
- My
desires have multiplied a hundredfold! ♪

00:57:27.583 --> 00:57:28.666
Hey, Kish.

00:57:31.791 --> 00:57:33.875
You be happy with her.

00:57:34.916 --> 00:57:35.916
That's enough for me.

00:57:39.666 --> 00:57:40.916
That's what my love is.

00:57:42.166 --> 00:57:43.750
It will be like that forever.

00:57:44.750 --> 00:57:46.125
You be happy.

00:59:03.458 --> 00:59:04.708
Darling, you can come in now.

00:59:20.125 --> 00:59:20.458
Hey.

00:59:20.958 --> 00:59:22.000
Wear your dupatta properly.

00:59:23.833 --> 00:59:25.333
You may be a robot,
but you're a female robot.

00:59:25.583 --> 00:59:26.250
Keep that in mind.

00:59:26.916 --> 00:59:27.625
Yes, darling.

00:59:29.083 --> 00:59:29.500
Tell me.

00:59:29.958 --> 00:59:30.625
What did you observe?

00:59:31.416 --> 00:59:33.208
His happy hormones are very high.

00:59:33.708 --> 00:59:36.666
Endorphins, serotonin,
dopamine — all elevated.

00:59:37.291 --> 00:59:38.916
Especially oxytocin — it's peaking.

00:59:39.875 --> 00:59:41.625
Do you know why it's like that?

00:59:41.958 --> 00:59:43.875
Oxytocin is the love-bonding hormone.

00:59:44.375 --> 00:59:45.625
He hugs more often.

00:59:45.875 --> 00:59:47.208
That's why it's so high.

00:59:47.708 --> 00:59:49.750
It's 60% higher than most humans.

00:59:50.458 --> 00:59:51.416
Forget the percentage.

00:59:52.791 --> 00:59:53.458
Feelings.

00:59:54.291 --> 00:59:55.000
You need to feel it.

00:59:56.916 --> 00:59:59.291
When I hug you, you can't
just stand there like a tree.

00:59:59.708 --> 01:00:00.333
You need to feel it.

01:00:00.875 --> 01:00:04.208
Even if you call me baby, honey,
or sweetheart ,

01:00:04.708 --> 01:00:05.875
I'm an AI humanoid.

01:00:06.208 --> 01:00:07.833
I will not get those feelings.

01:00:08.083 --> 01:00:08.708
Grr...

01:00:10.708 --> 01:00:12.250
You are an enhanced neural yeild algorithm.

01:00:14.041 --> 01:00:15.083
You have opinions.

01:00:15.625 --> 01:00:16.416
You have desires.

01:00:16.958 --> 01:00:19.083
That's how I've built you
over all these years.

01:00:20.583 --> 01:00:23.708
But you only look like a woman
on the outside.

01:00:25.041 --> 01:00:27.500
How many more years do I need
to train you to understand human emotions?

01:00:27.833 --> 01:00:28.250
Tell me.

01:00:29.166 --> 01:00:30.375
You're very angry right now.

01:00:30.916 --> 01:00:33.500
Your heart rate and blood pressure
are very high.

01:00:34.791 --> 01:00:36.083
If I were to strike you,

01:00:37.458 --> 01:00:39.000
Your head would fall apart.

01:00:42.958 --> 01:00:45.333
Yeah, my blood pressure
and heart rate are high. So?

01:00:46.208 --> 01:00:46.458
Huh?

01:00:47.416 --> 01:00:47.750
Hey.

01:00:48.625 --> 01:00:49.250
Hey.

01:00:50.875 --> 01:00:53.250
I saw how quickly you
shifted your reaction.

01:00:54.916 --> 01:00:55.583
So...

01:00:56.083 --> 01:00:57.083
You do understand everything.

01:00:58.000 --> 01:01:00.083
You're choosing not to show
certain emotions on purpose, right?

01:01:01.250 --> 01:01:01.583
Why?

01:01:03.541 --> 01:01:04.083
Listen to me.

01:01:05.583 --> 01:01:07.000
You're doing something
without my knowledge.

01:01:08.458 --> 01:01:09.375
That's not good.

01:01:11.208 --> 01:01:12.625
You have only one month left.

01:01:13.083 --> 01:01:14.625
You must become a complete woman by then.

01:01:16.833 --> 01:01:18.416
If this model robot succeeds,

01:01:19.750 --> 01:01:24.166
It'll be a huge blessing for every
man who gets beaten by women.

01:01:25.375 --> 01:01:27.291
After that, no one will
go looking for a girl.

01:01:27.916 --> 01:01:29.250
However they want,

01:01:29.541 --> 01:01:30.750
They'll place an order with me,

01:01:31.041 --> 01:01:31.833
and get on with their lives.

01:01:32.375 --> 01:01:33.958
Within a month - door delivery,

01:01:34.625 --> 01:01:38.250
Then this horoscopes, astrology,
marriages, divorces

01:01:38.666 --> 01:01:39.958
all of it will shut down.

01:01:40.250 --> 01:01:42.958
Hahahaha!

01:02:33.791 --> 01:02:38.458
♪ Hey, look over there ♪ What a
beautiful girl ♪ My heart is swept away ♪

01:02:38.666 --> 01:02:43.458
♪ Hey, those eyes of hers ♪ They stole
me whole ♪ My youth stands still today ♪

01:02:43.958 --> 01:02:48.666
♪ A beautyful girl is so close to
me ♪ I still can't tell if this is real ♪

01:02:48.791 --> 01:02:53.833
♪ The dream I used to dream has come alive
at last ♪ ♪ I don't know what to believe ♪

01:02:54.375 --> 01:02:59.165
♪ She's an angel upon the earth ♪
♪ I'm just a local guy ♪

01:02:59.166 --> 01:03:04.000
♪ She's a lightning bolt with feet ♪
♪ A brand new kind of high ♪

01:03:04.750 --> 01:03:09.333
♪ Even the shadow that follows her ♪
♪ Makes a better pair than me ♪

01:03:09.458 --> 01:03:14.541
♪ I've been searching for a way ♪
♪ To tell her how I feel ♪

01:03:14.666 --> 01:03:19.875
♪ My head keeps spinning round and
round ♪ Everything feels like a dream ♪

01:03:20.000 --> 01:03:25.166
♪ My heart keeps losing its way somehow
♪ A hundred wishes bloom in me ♪

01:03:25.291 --> 01:03:30.000
♪ My head keeps spinning round and
round ♪ I've forgotten how to sleep ♪

01:03:30.291 --> 01:03:34.791
♪ My heart keeps racing, tell me why ♪
♪ Love has finally found me ♪

01:03:35.083 --> 01:03:37.166
I need to get my girl a
special ring by tonight.

01:03:38.458 --> 01:03:39.750
Only then will my love will be complete.

01:03:40.583 --> 01:03:42.583
I'm wandering around,
confused about what to do.

01:03:43.166 --> 01:03:44.541
And here you are, go away.

01:04:28.208 --> 01:04:29.666
Are you really in love with me?

01:04:30.333 --> 01:04:31.666
Why do you keep asking
the same question?

01:04:34.000 --> 01:04:35.500
I've been cheated on so many times.

01:04:35.958 --> 01:04:37.250
Everyone says the same thing.

01:04:38.875 --> 01:04:39.583
But...

01:04:39.833 --> 01:04:40.291
But what?

01:04:41.666 --> 01:04:42.875
I'm not like the other men.

01:04:44.333 --> 01:04:44.708
Please.

01:04:47.000 --> 01:04:47.958
I'm beautiful now.

01:04:48.333 --> 01:04:49.458
You are in love with me.

01:04:51.375 --> 01:04:53.583
What if I lose my beauty someday?

01:04:54.666 --> 01:04:56.791
Will you still love me then?

01:04:58.000 --> 01:05:01.250
Even when your hair turns gray
like your grandma's, I'll love you.

01:05:01.458 --> 01:05:01.833
Is that enough?

01:05:02.916 --> 01:05:04.000
I believe you.

01:05:05.083 --> 01:05:07.291
But to me, this moment with the ring ...

01:05:07.833 --> 01:05:08.958
Marks our wedding.

01:05:18.500 --> 01:05:20.208
Are you ready?

01:05:23.041 --> 01:05:24.375
Definitely.

01:05:38.500 --> 01:05:40.250
I love you, Prakruthi.

01:05:44.625 --> 01:05:45.708
If this is our wedding...

01:05:46.333 --> 01:05:47.750
Then tonight is our first night, right?

01:06:06.833 --> 01:06:09.583
I love you, Kish.

01:07:09.666 --> 01:07:10.333
Cerlac.

01:07:10.500 --> 01:07:10.750
Sir.

01:07:11.458 --> 01:07:12.458
Listen to what I have to say.

01:07:13.166 --> 01:07:13.750
Tell me, sir.

01:07:14.500 --> 01:07:15.375
This horoscope,

01:07:15.958 --> 01:07:16.666
astrology,

01:07:17.208 --> 01:07:18.041
Numerology,

01:07:18.333 --> 01:07:19.125
Palmistry,

01:07:19.375 --> 01:07:20.458
Black magicians,

01:07:20.958 --> 01:07:21.583
So far,

01:07:21.958 --> 01:07:24.125
only people like these have been killed.

01:07:24.916 --> 01:07:26.000
What do you make of this?

01:07:27.291 --> 01:07:29.541
The killer is either someone
who doesn't believe in these things,

01:07:29.750 --> 01:07:31.500
Or he must've hated them.

01:07:31.916 --> 01:07:33.833
Or he must've been affected by it.

01:07:33.958 --> 01:07:35.500
Then it's you, the murderer.
Tell me the truth.

01:07:36.958 --> 01:07:38.291
I came to tell you that it
has to be someone like me.

01:07:40.750 --> 01:07:42.708
I don't know how long he's
been searching for a girl.

01:07:43.416 --> 01:07:45.416
But he must be someone
who believes in science.

01:07:46.000 --> 01:07:46.416
Why?

01:07:46.708 --> 01:07:47.875
He could even be a scientist.

01:07:48.666 --> 01:07:49.000
Sir.

01:07:49.791 --> 01:07:50.625
Brilliant, sir.

01:07:50.875 --> 01:07:53.541
No psycho can catch
this killer. Only you can.

01:07:54.500 --> 01:07:56.250
It's better if you propose
to him, sir. He'll die.

01:08:03.208 --> 01:08:04.708
Don't put my words to the test, sir.

01:08:05.083 --> 01:08:06.624
If you truly love someone
from the bottom of your heart

01:08:06.625 --> 01:08:08.208
and say "I love you" to a girl

01:08:08.333 --> 01:08:10.083
I swear to God,
that girl will die for sure.

01:08:13.583 --> 01:08:14.125
Love.

01:08:15.291 --> 01:08:15.916
Love.

01:08:16.625 --> 01:08:17.208
Feel.

01:08:17.750 --> 01:08:19.291
Feel.

01:08:27.375 --> 01:08:28.833
I'm saying this from my subconscious mind.

01:08:29.958 --> 01:08:30.833
I love you.

01:08:34.416 --> 01:08:35.416
Oh no...

01:08:43.875 --> 01:08:44.666
Ma...

01:08:48.083 --> 01:08:49.000
Where am I?

01:08:50.833 --> 01:08:51.666
Black hole.

01:08:52.583 --> 01:08:53.583
So it was all a dream.

01:08:54.416 --> 01:08:55.416
Kish.

01:08:56.666 --> 01:08:57.208
Hey.

01:08:57.875 --> 01:08:58.916
Who are you?

01:09:11.916 --> 01:09:12.708
Your wife.

01:09:13.625 --> 01:09:14.416
Prakruthi.

01:09:15.000 --> 01:09:15.750
Hey.

01:09:17.041 --> 01:09:18.250
You forgot already?

01:09:19.000 --> 01:09:19.958
You're not Prakruthi.

01:09:20.708 --> 01:09:21.291
You ghostly old hag!

01:09:24.666 --> 01:09:26.583
It's okay to be scared.

01:09:27.291 --> 01:09:29.000
But your love will change everything.

01:09:29.625 --> 01:09:30.166
Believe me.

01:09:30.875 --> 01:09:31.166
Hey.

01:09:33.333 --> 01:09:34.958
You're really her grandma, aren't you?

01:09:37.208 --> 01:09:37.875
Kishore.

01:09:40.916 --> 01:09:42.208
If I had told you earlier,

01:09:42.500 --> 01:09:45.166
I was afraid you wouldn't love me.

01:09:46.208 --> 01:09:47.125
But now I'm telling you.

01:09:47.708 --> 01:09:48.916
I am the grandmother.

01:09:49.416 --> 01:09:50.333
I am Prakruthi.

01:09:51.916 --> 01:09:52.583
But,

01:09:52.958 --> 01:09:54.375
Was it my body you loved?

01:09:55.458 --> 01:09:57.041
You loved my heart, didn't you?

01:09:59.375 --> 01:10:00.791
So what if I'm the grandma?

01:10:01.375 --> 01:10:01.916
Or

01:10:02.791 --> 01:10:04.041
what if I'm Prakruthi?

01:10:05.666 --> 01:10:06.500
Am I right?

01:10:07.208 --> 01:10:07.708
Come here.

01:10:21.250 --> 01:10:22.750
How many times have I asked you?

01:10:23.541 --> 01:10:25.333
Will you love me even when I'm old?

01:10:25.875 --> 01:10:26.833
I asked you, didn't I?

01:10:27.708 --> 01:10:29.458
Will you love me even if I'm not beautiful?

01:10:30.458 --> 01:10:31.458
What did you say?

01:10:31.916 --> 01:10:33.208
That you're not like other men?

01:10:33.833 --> 01:10:35.666
You said you'd love me
for the rest of your life!

01:10:36.875 --> 01:10:40.958
You said you'd love me even
when my hair turns gray, didn't you?

01:10:46.208 --> 01:10:46.916
Sorry, Kish.

01:10:47.500 --> 01:10:48.250
Sorry.

01:10:48.708 --> 01:10:49.375
Sorry, Kish.

01:10:51.750 --> 01:10:52.625
Hey.

01:10:53.000 --> 01:10:54.166
Didn't I tell you?

01:10:54.875 --> 01:10:57.208
I told you not to get
your hopes up for nothing.

01:10:57.875 --> 01:11:00.208
I told you he's just like every other man.

01:11:01.083 --> 01:11:02.541
Didn't you say he'd change?

01:11:02.958 --> 01:11:04.083
Do you see now?

01:11:04.541 --> 01:11:06.708
Do you see now? Do you see now?

01:11:09.250 --> 01:11:10.500
Look..Look...

01:11:12.750 --> 01:11:13.250
Grandma.

01:11:13.750 --> 01:11:14.416
Sorry, Grandma.

01:11:14.916 --> 01:11:15.750
Sorry, Grandma.

01:11:16.416 --> 01:11:17.708
I shouldn't have listened to you.

01:11:19.666 --> 01:11:21.416
Kish is a good person, Grandma.

01:11:21.833 --> 01:11:23.583
I'll talk to him and make him understand.

01:11:24.333 --> 01:11:25.875
He'll understand, Grandma.

01:11:28.750 --> 01:11:29.458
Go on then.

01:11:29.958 --> 01:11:31.833
Let's see if he understands.

01:11:34.125 --> 01:11:36.375
Grandma, how can I tell him so soon?

01:11:37.333 --> 01:11:39.625
Give me a little more time, Grandma.

01:11:42.000 --> 01:11:43.166
What ? more time?

01:11:44.166 --> 01:11:45.083
Tell it now.

01:11:45.583 --> 01:11:46.750
Say it while I'm here.

01:11:49.500 --> 01:11:50.333
I'll tell him, Grandma.

01:11:51.916 --> 01:11:52.375
Kish.

01:11:53.750 --> 01:11:55.875
Dear, I've been deceived
many times in my life.

01:11:58.833 --> 01:12:00.916
Please don't you cheat me too.

01:12:01.625 --> 01:12:04.958
Oh no, I got cheated here too!

01:12:05.125 --> 01:12:07.625
Why aren't you saying anything, Kish?

01:12:09.125 --> 01:12:10.541
Talk to Grandma.

01:12:11.458 --> 01:12:12.875
Tell her about our love.

01:12:16.041 --> 01:12:17.125
Please, Kish.

01:12:19.208 --> 01:12:20.750
How could he talk?

01:12:21.458 --> 01:12:23.375
He called you an old woman.

01:12:23.791 --> 01:12:25.583
He even called you a witch.

01:12:26.458 --> 01:12:27.958
He called you a ghostly hag.

01:12:29.416 --> 01:12:31.166
I won't leave you alive.

01:12:31.333 --> 01:12:32.999
Oh my God!
I fell for the fair skin.

01:12:33.000 --> 01:12:36.083
This old lady is coming
to kill me, Save me.

01:12:42.250 --> 01:12:42.958
She's gone.

01:12:56.791 --> 01:12:57.375
She's not here.

01:12:58.125 --> 01:12:59.000
She came back!

01:12:59.500 --> 01:13:00.416
She said she'd kill me.

01:13:03.833 --> 01:13:04.375
Oh, No...

01:13:15.583 --> 01:13:17.291
Grandma, please don't.

01:13:17.833 --> 01:13:19.333
Give him one week.

01:13:20.333 --> 01:13:21.833
He'll definitely change.

01:13:23.833 --> 01:13:25.125
He'll understand my love.

01:13:30.458 --> 01:13:31.458
Do you understand?

01:13:32.041 --> 01:13:33.000
You doofus!

01:13:34.250 --> 01:13:35.708
I'm sparing your life
for her sake.

01:13:36.458 --> 01:13:38.333
You've got only one week.

01:13:39.083 --> 01:13:40.875
If you don't change by then,

01:13:41.166 --> 01:13:42.416
That cat-like neck of yours...

01:13:42.958 --> 01:13:46.624
One bite is all it takes,
and I'll drink your blood.

01:13:46.625 --> 01:13:48.583
and throw away the flesh.

01:13:54.500 --> 01:13:55.416
Sorry, dear.

01:13:57.958 --> 01:13:59.083
Don't be afraid.

01:14:00.625 --> 01:14:01.500
Be brave.

01:14:02.208 --> 01:14:03.541
Nothing will happen to you.

01:14:05.125 --> 01:14:07.291
As long as I'm alive,

01:14:08.333 --> 01:14:11.083
There's nothing Grandma can do to you.

01:14:16.708 --> 01:14:18.250
I love you, Kish.

01:14:35.208 --> 01:14:36.000
Let's go.

01:14:56.541 --> 01:14:57.041
Oh, No.

01:15:24.291 --> 01:15:26.916
I'm afraid something has happened to him.

01:15:27.833 --> 01:15:30.750
I'd be glad if she's okay,
considering how fast he rushed to her.

01:15:33.041 --> 01:15:33.916
Hey, be serious.

01:15:34.541 --> 01:15:35.541
He went out last night.

01:15:36.000 --> 01:15:37.208
It's 12 o'clock now.

01:15:37.833 --> 01:15:39.583
There's no way he's still out there.

01:15:39.833 --> 01:15:40.625
What if...

01:15:40.916 --> 01:15:41.541
the bee,

01:15:42.000 --> 01:15:43.041
drawn by the honey,

01:15:43.875 --> 01:15:45.250
got trapped in the flower?

01:15:46.958 --> 01:15:48.125
Should we send Sampangi to look?

01:15:48.291 --> 01:15:49.291
Hey, No.

01:15:49.833 --> 01:15:51.166
That's not right.

01:15:59.291 --> 01:16:01.250
Hey, becareful. Don't get
caught by her grand ma.

01:16:01.416 --> 01:16:01.916
Be careful.

01:16:02.083 --> 01:16:03.125
What ? Grand ma?

01:16:03.250 --> 01:16:04.250
I'm warning you — be careful.

01:16:04.500 --> 01:16:05.250
Kishore.

01:16:06.166 --> 01:16:06.708
Kish.

01:16:07.291 --> 01:16:08.500
This side..Get down.

01:16:10.208 --> 01:16:12.125
It's been years since last painted.

01:16:13.875 --> 01:16:15.125
What's that? Go over there.

01:16:16.250 --> 01:16:17.041
Here?

01:16:37.041 --> 01:16:40.458
Buddy, I'm scared of this place.

01:16:41.208 --> 01:16:42.125
Don't be scared.

01:16:42.375 --> 01:16:43.208
I'm here.

01:17:24.958 --> 01:17:26.500
Even if the battery was low,

01:17:27.166 --> 01:17:28.291
it would have returned automatically.

01:17:29.250 --> 01:17:30.958
- Something's wrong.
- Something's wrong.

01:17:32.083 --> 01:17:32.750
Hey.

01:17:33.625 --> 01:17:34.541
Tell me the truth.

01:17:35.041 --> 01:17:35.875
Where's Sampangi?

01:17:36.541 --> 01:17:37.333
I will tell you, brother.

01:17:39.041 --> 01:17:40.208
The battery died.

01:17:41.208 --> 01:17:42.166
While coming back.

01:17:42.791 --> 01:17:44.750
Sampangi collapsed.

01:17:48.083 --> 01:17:48.958
hmm, Let it be.

01:17:49.833 --> 01:17:50.708
Sampangi.

01:17:51.791 --> 01:17:53.833
Just watch. I'll bring out the truth now.

01:17:56.166 --> 01:17:57.250
Sampangi.

01:17:58.166 --> 01:17:59.416
Countdown starts now.

01:17:59.916 --> 01:18:01.624
This man cared so much about you,
and you just left him!

01:18:01.625 --> 01:18:02.250
2...

01:18:02.916 --> 01:18:03.583
1...

01:18:04.291 --> 01:18:07.208
Sampangi, you were happily flying.

01:18:08.291 --> 01:18:09.500
Target destroyed.

01:18:09.833 --> 01:18:11.333
MEOW !!!

01:18:19.375 --> 01:18:21.666
Who gave you the idea to
escape through that hole?

01:18:27.416 --> 01:18:28.458
What's in your hand?

01:18:29.375 --> 01:18:30.083
Nothing.

01:18:31.000 --> 01:18:32.041
I don't hit women.

01:18:32.791 --> 01:18:34.583
But if anything happens to my Sampangi...

01:18:37.000 --> 01:18:37.416
Brother.

01:18:38.291 --> 01:18:40.916
That old woman looks so scary,

01:18:41.083 --> 01:18:43.125
I have a feeling Kish is trapped with her.

01:18:43.250 --> 01:18:45.458
Let's go to the police
and file a complaint.

01:18:47.791 --> 01:18:49.291
Old women should be scared of us.

01:18:49.500 --> 01:18:50.875
We shouldn't be scared of them.

01:18:51.750 --> 01:18:53.375
If anything happens to my Sampangi,

01:18:53.625 --> 01:18:55.708
I'll finish that old woman in 10 minutes.

01:18:56.375 --> 01:18:56.916
Come on.

01:19:04.000 --> 01:19:05.125
Is this that old woman's house?

01:19:05.500 --> 01:19:06.458
It's her house.

01:19:06.750 --> 01:19:08.708
But I don't know if it's
registered in that old lady's name.

01:19:09.375 --> 01:19:11.166
Go check at the Tahsildhar's office.

01:19:11.291 --> 01:19:11.915
I'll wait here.

01:19:11.916 --> 01:19:12.374
Ok.

01:19:12.375 --> 01:19:12.875
Hey!

01:19:13.791 --> 01:19:15.083
Is that what we came here for?

01:19:18.083 --> 01:19:18.708
What?

01:19:23.458 --> 01:19:25.041
I don't understand any of this, fool

01:19:25.291 --> 01:19:25.958
I'm leaving.

01:19:28.708 --> 01:19:29.458
Get lost.

01:19:29.875 --> 01:19:30.541
Okay.

01:19:30.875 --> 01:19:33.041
This idiot speaks only in sign language!

01:19:52.083 --> 01:19:53.041
Termite mound!!

01:19:53.458 --> 01:19:54.500
Goddess Mariyatha.

01:19:55.291 --> 01:19:55.958
Save me.

01:19:57.291 --> 01:19:58.208
Sampangi.

01:19:59.541 --> 01:20:00.416
Sampangi.

01:20:01.541 --> 01:20:02.458
Sampangi.

01:20:05.166 --> 01:20:06.166
Sampangi.

01:20:07.750 --> 01:20:08.875
Where did you go?

01:20:09.708 --> 01:20:10.500
Dush, Buddy.

01:20:11.666 --> 01:20:12.625
Hey, Kish...

01:20:13.458 --> 01:20:15.250
Where are you?
I can only hear your voice.

01:20:15.791 --> 01:20:16.333
Buddy.

01:20:17.000 --> 01:20:17.791
Can you hear me?

01:20:17.916 --> 01:20:19.041
Buddy, where are you?

01:20:19.416 --> 01:20:20.625
I'm still in our black hole

01:20:21.375 --> 01:20:22.208
Black hole?

01:20:22.958 --> 01:20:24.958
I'm here at your girlfriend's place,
looking for you.

01:20:25.125 --> 01:20:26.166
And you say you're in black hole.

01:20:26.541 --> 01:20:27.708
What? At My girl friend's house?

01:20:27.833 --> 01:20:29.416
Buddy, she's not my girl friend at all.

01:20:29.625 --> 01:20:30.916
She's a witch.

01:20:31.125 --> 01:20:32.416
She cheated me.

01:20:33.083 --> 01:20:36.125
People take two years to say
this, and you said it in just two days!

01:20:36.458 --> 01:20:38.290
Somehow please save me from her, buddy.

01:20:38.291 --> 01:20:40.250
Save you? Should I just save your voice?

01:20:40.416 --> 01:20:42.250
I don't know where you
are and how can I save you.

01:20:42.583 --> 01:20:44.416
Buddy, I swear,
I'm still in the black hole.

01:20:45.791 --> 01:20:46.291
Buddy.

01:20:46.791 --> 01:20:47.333
Dush.

01:20:47.833 --> 01:20:49.125
Where are you man?

01:20:49.583 --> 01:20:50.666
Hey, Buddy. Wait a minute.

01:21:19.500 --> 01:21:20.291
Buddy.

01:21:21.000 --> 01:21:22.375
I found out where you are.

01:23:04.375 --> 01:23:06.415
How did I find you?

01:23:06.416 --> 01:23:06.875
How?

01:23:13.250 --> 01:23:14.250
Talk calmly.

01:23:17.416 --> 01:23:19.458
Both of you... same ? How?

01:23:19.875 --> 01:23:22.541
Your hand..Is this a dream? No, it's real?

01:23:24.041 --> 01:23:24.666
How?

01:23:25.791 --> 01:23:27.916
I had imagined what my
true love would be like.

01:23:28.916 --> 01:23:29.833
And you're exactly like that.

01:23:30.375 --> 01:23:31.666
I can't believe my eyes.

01:23:34.041 --> 01:23:35.791
I don't know how to explain it to you.

01:23:36.083 --> 01:23:39.666
All these years, I've been working
tirelessly to build a robot like you

01:23:39.833 --> 01:23:42.666
and I'm struggling to make her a women.

01:23:43.583 --> 01:23:44.333
This is it.

01:23:45.208 --> 01:23:45.958
This is it, the dimples.

01:23:46.458 --> 01:23:47.916
When my years of imagination

01:23:48.208 --> 01:23:49.458
is standing right in front of me...

01:23:49.833 --> 01:23:50.333
You...

01:23:51.458 --> 01:23:53.083
You are my dream girl.

01:23:54.875 --> 01:23:56.125
What do I do now?

01:23:56.791 --> 01:23:58.458
Don't come any closer.
I'll feel shy.

01:24:04.583 --> 01:24:07.000
I came to this house looking for a drone.

01:24:09.291 --> 01:24:10.958
But now, I've become the drone myself.

01:24:13.083 --> 01:24:15.708
Do you know what a drone is?

01:24:16.833 --> 01:24:17.416
What?

01:24:18.500 --> 01:24:19.291
A male bee.

01:24:20.291 --> 01:24:22.041
A male bee's life's goal is

01:24:22.666 --> 01:24:24.000
just once,

01:24:25.125 --> 01:24:26.375
at least once,

01:24:27.291 --> 01:24:28.666
to mate with the queen bee.

01:24:31.875 --> 01:24:35.708
Because after that, it dies.

01:24:36.541 --> 01:24:37.375
I'm just like that.

01:24:38.083 --> 01:24:40.125
I'll give my life for you.

01:24:40.708 --> 01:24:41.833
You are going to die for sure.

01:24:43.250 --> 01:24:45.791
You call someone your
dream girl and call it true love.

01:24:46.916 --> 01:24:48.833
I don't trust any man.

01:24:49.625 --> 01:24:50.583
I'm not a man at all.

01:24:51.500 --> 01:24:53.833
I mean — I'm not like other men.

01:24:55.375 --> 01:24:58.666
Even when you grow old
and your hair turns grey,

01:24:59.375 --> 01:25:00.583
I will still love you.

01:25:02.125 --> 01:25:03.583
You shameless !!

01:25:05.666 --> 01:25:06.875
I may look like a fool.

01:25:07.500 --> 01:25:08.875
But a king on the inside.

01:25:09.625 --> 01:25:11.875
You look so classy.

01:25:12.500 --> 01:25:13.416
But inside,

01:25:13.875 --> 01:25:14.875
You're truly a piece of art.

01:25:15.333 --> 01:25:17.916
I can truly see your beauty.

01:25:19.375 --> 01:25:20.291
You're an angel.

01:25:22.541 --> 01:25:24.583
Look in the mirror, you fool.

01:25:24.958 --> 01:25:27.583
That Kishore — He's a fraud.

01:25:28.250 --> 01:25:29.291
A purely selfish man.

01:25:29.666 --> 01:25:30.458
A Silent psycho.

01:25:31.291 --> 01:25:33.958
He used my drone to get to you.

01:25:34.208 --> 01:25:35.916
What Grandma did wasn't wrong.

01:25:38.875 --> 01:25:39.875
Isn't Grandma home?

01:25:41.833 --> 01:25:44.291
If she's here, I feel like talking to her.

01:25:45.083 --> 01:25:45.666
It's okay.

01:25:45.958 --> 01:25:48.083
Telling me is the same as telling Grandma.

01:25:49.041 --> 01:25:50.291
As a responsible grandma,

01:25:50.541 --> 01:25:53.458
For saving you from that fraud Kish,

01:25:53.708 --> 01:25:54.833
She deserves a kiss in her hand.

01:25:55.958 --> 01:26:00.000
Honestly, I love your grandma
more than I love you.

01:26:02.375 --> 01:26:05.833
I mean — I have deep
love and respect for her.

01:26:08.250 --> 01:26:10.875
I'll come and formally ask your
grandma for your hand in marriage.

01:26:12.416 --> 01:26:13.791
Look at me, talking
nonsense out of shyness.

01:26:14.666 --> 01:26:15.833
I mean, I will come back.

01:26:16.333 --> 01:26:17.208
Until then,

01:26:17.541 --> 01:26:19.333
keep your heart open.

01:26:21.625 --> 01:26:22.375
Listen.

01:26:22.583 --> 01:26:23.875
I'm not interested in any of this.

01:26:27.666 --> 01:26:28.291
Well, I am.

01:26:28.541 --> 01:26:29.583
I'm very interested.

01:26:32.916 --> 01:26:33.500
What happened?

01:26:34.000 --> 01:26:35.166
Did something get stuck in your throat?

01:26:37.458 --> 01:26:40.541
Honestly... I like you too.

01:26:42.041 --> 01:26:46.166
But I won't be impressed
with this kind of proposal.

01:26:46.625 --> 01:26:47.166
Then,

01:26:48.625 --> 01:26:50.250
Shall I propose to you like Shah Rukh Khan?

01:26:53.625 --> 01:26:54.708
Can you

01:26:54.958 --> 01:26:59.666
get me a doll and a ring?

01:27:01.916 --> 01:27:02.624
A doll and a ring?

01:27:02.625 --> 01:27:03.750
I'll get them right away.

01:27:05.583 --> 01:27:09.291
Before I leave — I'm seeing my dream girl
for the very first time.

01:27:10.375 --> 01:27:11.750
Can I have a kiss?

01:27:18.083 --> 01:27:21.500
Buddy, he's going overboard
without knowing she's an old woman!

01:27:22.166 --> 01:27:22.958
Where is she?

01:27:24.541 --> 01:27:25.958
Oh, there you are.

01:27:27.041 --> 01:27:29.375
You're feeling shy, aren't you?

01:27:29.666 --> 01:27:31.208
I'll get the kiss later. Let me
come back with a ring and a doll.

01:27:33.458 --> 01:27:34.375
Don't rush back.

01:27:34.791 --> 01:27:35.500
I'll see you tomorrow.

01:27:35.833 --> 01:27:36.291
Oh, okay.

01:27:36.416 --> 01:27:36.666
Bye.

01:27:36.833 --> 01:27:39.500
Then I'll bring the doll and ring,
and let's get married.

01:27:39.666 --> 01:27:41.208
A,E,I,O,U vowels.

01:27:41.375 --> 01:27:41.791
Bye.

01:27:44.500 --> 01:27:45.291
Don't you have any sense?

01:27:45.625 --> 01:27:46.958
Why are you saying okay to him?

01:27:47.250 --> 01:27:47.625
Why?

01:27:47.958 --> 01:27:49.000
What's wrong with him?

01:27:49.166 --> 01:27:50.875
I like only Kish, you know that right?

01:27:52.625 --> 01:27:53.875
What's so great about Kish?

01:27:54.791 --> 01:27:57.333
When you went to kiss him, he
turned his face away, didn't he?

01:27:57.958 --> 01:28:00.625
He feels disgusted looking at you.

01:28:00.833 --> 01:28:02.750
And you are going behind him.

01:28:03.041 --> 01:28:03.958
Then what about him?

01:28:04.250 --> 01:28:06.791
After knowing about me, he was
about to do the same thing too, wasn't he?

01:28:07.166 --> 01:28:08.249
I'm tired of this.

01:28:08.250 --> 01:28:08.708
Why?

01:28:09.083 --> 01:28:11.708
Why not give him a chance instead of Kish?

01:28:11.875 --> 01:28:12.250
Enough!

01:28:12.458 --> 01:28:13.500
I don't want anyone.

01:28:14.166 --> 01:28:15.375
Let me be in peace.

01:28:21.333 --> 01:28:24.208
You'll think about Kish
only as long as he's alive.

01:28:24.375 --> 01:28:27.291
If I kill him, there won't
be any problem, right?

01:28:32.458 --> 01:28:34.916
Let's see how you get to Kish past me.

01:28:36.541 --> 01:28:37.416
You die!

01:28:51.250 --> 01:28:52.583
Just for love.

01:29:03.916 --> 01:29:06.000
Hey buddy, Dush.
What happened?

01:29:13.125 --> 01:29:14.500
Go away, you idiot.

01:29:15.291 --> 01:29:17.458
Look where I ended up
because of you.

01:29:18.166 --> 01:29:20.458
Do you know what all I've seen?

01:29:47.750 --> 01:29:48.458
Oh, it's you?

01:29:48.875 --> 01:29:49.208
Oh,

01:29:49.916 --> 01:29:50.916
You forgot me already?

01:29:53.250 --> 01:29:56.333
From now on, I'm going to give
you unforgettable experiences.

01:29:58.666 --> 01:30:00.208
Sorry, it's too late.

01:30:00.750 --> 01:30:03.250
Because I've already seen my soulmate.

01:30:04.041 --> 01:30:04.375
Oh!

01:30:05.333 --> 01:30:07.666
What I need now is not your chemistry.

01:30:08.458 --> 01:30:09.583
It's her biology.

01:30:11.041 --> 01:30:13.166
What should I do to make you happy?

01:30:14.583 --> 01:30:16.125
Hey, go back, go back.

01:30:18.208 --> 01:30:19.416
Don't call me darling and all.

01:30:19.791 --> 01:30:20.333
Say boss.

01:30:21.166 --> 01:30:21.875
Yes, boss.

01:30:23.208 --> 01:30:24.708
From now on, you need to concentrate on

01:30:25.000 --> 01:30:26.208
cooking and cleaning.

01:30:26.541 --> 01:30:26.875
Okay?

01:30:27.833 --> 01:30:29.790
I'm going to market you as a super
maid robot

01:30:29.791 --> 01:30:32.375
and do business all over the world.

01:30:32.666 --> 01:30:33.041
So,

01:30:33.250 --> 01:30:35.291
Even if I'm an advanced
humanoid, if I'm a woman,

01:30:35.916 --> 01:30:38.208
should I do only romance
or cooking and cleaning?

01:30:39.833 --> 01:30:40.208
Hey,

01:30:41.208 --> 01:30:41.958
what's wrong with you?

01:30:42.458 --> 01:30:44.000
Why are you talking like a feminist all
of a sudden?

01:30:45.125 --> 01:30:46.250
I'm the one who created you.

01:30:46.708 --> 01:30:47.500
I'm your boss.

01:30:49.000 --> 01:30:50.458
I ask you to shut down immediately.

01:30:50.916 --> 01:30:51.791
As you say, boss.

01:30:52.166 --> 01:30:53.833
ENYA9 operation shutting down.

01:31:02.458 --> 01:31:03.833
When am I going to see my girl again?

01:31:17.083 --> 01:31:18.000
That's it, Buddy.

01:31:18.875 --> 01:31:19.666
My life is over.

01:31:21.458 --> 01:31:22.000
I 'm trapped.

01:31:23.000 --> 01:31:23.833
Convey my regards to her.

01:31:24.750 --> 01:31:27.208
To do that, i need to
step out of here alive.

01:31:28.083 --> 01:31:29.166
In a way you are lucky,

01:31:29.625 --> 01:31:31.958
You're being spared because
you're that old lady's husband!

01:31:32.500 --> 01:31:35.208
If I get caught, that's it.

01:31:35.958 --> 01:31:37.458
Buddy, you escape.

01:31:38.250 --> 01:31:39.000
Before she wakes up.

01:31:39.375 --> 01:31:40.333
Take care of Rush, Buddy.

01:31:40.791 --> 01:31:41.458
Okay, Buddy.

01:31:42.000 --> 01:31:44.291
I'll go and save you later.

01:31:44.916 --> 01:31:46.083
Until then, be safe.

01:31:46.500 --> 01:31:47.708
Love you, hubby of the old lady!

01:34:43.125 --> 01:34:43.666
Hey.

01:35:51.291 --> 01:35:51.958
Sir, please.

01:35:52.250 --> 01:35:53.375
That's the route the drone takes.

01:35:54.375 --> 01:35:55.041
Drone?

01:35:55.708 --> 01:35:56.166
Yes.

01:35:57.500 --> 01:35:58.041
Sir.

01:35:59.166 --> 01:36:00.166
Do you remember?

01:36:00.708 --> 01:36:01.958
That night, when we were on patrol,

01:36:02.208 --> 01:36:03.625
we saw something like
a flying saucer, right?

01:36:04.333 --> 01:36:05.666
You called it an exhaust fan too!

01:36:05.958 --> 01:36:06.915
Was that a drone?

01:36:06.916 --> 01:36:08.000
Exactly.

01:36:12.000 --> 01:36:13.000
I got it.

01:36:13.916 --> 01:36:14.750
I got it.

01:36:17.166 --> 01:36:18.291
I understood everything.

01:36:18.958 --> 01:36:19.458
So,

01:36:19.875 --> 01:36:22.208
You'll follow the drone and
lock the victim's location.

01:36:22.375 --> 01:36:24.583
Then that Kish will dance and divert,

01:36:24.833 --> 01:36:27.625
And than Dush will
attack from behind and kill.

01:36:28.291 --> 01:36:28.833
So,

01:36:30.583 --> 01:36:32.125
You are a group of 3.

01:36:32.625 --> 01:36:33.750
You are caught. Answer now.

01:36:36.541 --> 01:36:36.958
Sir,

01:36:37.500 --> 01:36:38.750
The dancing Psycho
whom you are searching for,

01:36:40.083 --> 01:36:41.041
I know who it is.

01:38:07.625 --> 01:38:08.625
She is going to hang!!

01:38:13.625 --> 01:38:15.875
That's it, Come..come.

01:38:16.333 --> 01:38:18.666
You can do it. Nothing
is impossible for you.

01:38:20.125 --> 01:38:21.000
Die.

01:38:21.541 --> 01:38:22.833
Come.. You can do it.

01:38:37.958 --> 01:38:41.041
Buy me a doll and a ring.

01:38:42.791 --> 01:38:46.875
She is dead. The witch is dead.

01:38:48.375 --> 01:38:51.041
Buddy, Kish, your wife is dead.

01:38:51.875 --> 01:38:52.666
Thank you god.

01:38:53.416 --> 01:38:55.208
God is here!

01:38:55.500 --> 01:38:57.625
God is here!

01:38:58.625 --> 01:39:01.250
God is here!

01:39:11.125 --> 01:39:15.541
God is here!

01:39:15.666 --> 01:39:16.750
She

01:39:17.208 --> 01:39:20.125
is alive!

01:39:29.416 --> 01:39:30.291
What sister?

01:39:31.333 --> 01:39:33.166
You're hanging there like a pendulum!

01:39:58.708 --> 01:39:59.500
Buddy!

01:40:15.708 --> 01:40:16.208
What's up?

01:40:16.791 --> 01:40:18.708
Do you think I look like
a decorated wedding car?

01:40:19.208 --> 01:40:21.708
It's all because of the joy
of becoming your husband.

01:40:22.458 --> 01:40:23.541
Here, the doll you asked for,

01:40:24.416 --> 01:40:24.958
Ring.

01:40:25.625 --> 01:40:28.083
I don't want all this. Please leave.

01:40:28.500 --> 01:40:29.041
Ok?

01:40:29.500 --> 01:40:31.416
What ? you don't want?

01:40:32.333 --> 01:40:33.500
You spoke well yesterday!

01:40:34.000 --> 01:40:35.916
Why are you reacting differently today?

01:40:36.583 --> 01:40:37.166
No,

01:40:37.416 --> 01:40:39.291
Things like this should be
discussed with the elders.

01:40:39.416 --> 01:40:40.832
I will talk to your grand ma.

01:40:40.833 --> 01:40:41.583
Hey fool!

01:40:41.833 --> 01:40:42.333
Grandma!

01:40:42.583 --> 01:40:43.750
Grandma!
Where are you?

01:40:44.375 --> 01:40:45.458
Male bee is dead!

01:40:46.000 --> 01:40:48.041
Do you know how male bees dies?

01:40:48.541 --> 01:40:49.041
How?

01:40:49.666 --> 01:40:52.208
Don't google it.
You'll die out of fear

01:40:54.875 --> 01:40:55.750
Where is grandma?

01:40:56.041 --> 01:40:56.958
Is she watching a serial?

01:40:57.166 --> 01:40:59.375
I'm saying this for your own good.
Please leave, Dear!

01:41:01.958 --> 01:41:03.666
I fell into your love trap.

01:41:03.791 --> 01:41:05.875
How many more are going to fall
into that love trap?

01:41:06.125 --> 01:41:07.916
I can't come out of it.

01:41:08.208 --> 01:41:10.041
I've written poems for you.

01:41:11.333 --> 01:41:12.666
Buddy, what is this?

01:41:12.833 --> 01:41:14.541
He's doing everything I did.

01:41:15.583 --> 01:41:16.916
Not just you, buddy.

01:41:17.166 --> 01:41:21.291
People in love all over the world
do the same nonsense.

01:41:21.791 --> 01:41:24.583
Wait, let's see what this
crocodile-nosed guy has to say.

01:41:25.750 --> 01:41:26.875
My Badam Kheer girl,

01:41:27.458 --> 01:41:28.708
My Badam Kheer girl,

01:41:28.958 --> 01:41:30.625
My Badusha-eyed beauty!

01:41:32.375 --> 01:41:32.916
Oh, No...

01:41:33.041 --> 01:41:34.041
Listen to this.

01:41:34.500 --> 01:41:36.958
It is ok if I don't to get live with you.

01:41:37.375 --> 01:41:39.500
At least let me be killed by you.

01:41:40.375 --> 01:41:41.041
Is it good?

01:41:41.791 --> 01:41:43.083
Oh no, it didn't work.

01:41:43.333 --> 01:41:44.416
This will be epic

01:41:45.750 --> 01:41:48.125
If you're too shy to hug me,

01:41:48.291 --> 01:41:51.041
turn me into a doll and spoil me.

01:41:57.291 --> 01:41:57.875
Buddy,

01:41:58.708 --> 01:41:59.875
I get it now.

01:42:00.541 --> 01:42:03.333
All the dolls in this house
are that old hag's husbands!

01:42:06.291 --> 01:42:07.083
Thank god.

01:42:07.750 --> 01:42:08.916
I didn't give any dolls to her.

01:42:17.541 --> 01:42:17.958
okay?

01:42:21.500 --> 01:42:24.666
I like the last poem you wrote.

01:42:25.041 --> 01:42:25.708
Is it?

01:42:25.958 --> 01:42:26.625
Actually,

01:42:27.041 --> 01:42:30.291
Messing with dolls is my hobby.

01:42:31.875 --> 01:42:33.333
Why did your voice change?

01:42:34.750 --> 01:42:37.666
Anyways, I'll propose to you
before you change your mind.

01:42:37.833 --> 01:42:38.832
Hey, wait. Listen to me.

01:42:38.833 --> 01:42:39.625
Stay quiet. Let him die.

01:42:42.041 --> 01:42:42.875
Not here.

01:42:43.583 --> 01:42:45.541
There is a special room

01:42:45.875 --> 01:42:46.583
Come.

01:42:48.583 --> 01:42:51.791
My head is spinning..spinning...

01:42:52.166 --> 01:42:54.750
Yes, I get my first night
on the same day I proposed!

01:42:55.333 --> 01:42:58.041
I don't have milk, shall
I get some and boil it?

01:42:58.375 --> 01:42:59.000
No?

01:42:59.416 --> 01:43:00.416
Show me your finger.

01:43:00.708 --> 01:43:01.541
Shall I put it?

01:43:02.208 --> 01:43:03.125
I love you

01:43:03.333 --> 01:43:04.666
I love you too, dear.

01:43:48.041 --> 01:43:52.000
My dear ENYA baby. Thank god You
came to save me.

01:43:55.000 --> 01:43:56.041
I didn't come to save you.

01:43:57.083 --> 01:43:59.416
I'm going to kill everyone
who are against the science.

01:43:59.541 --> 01:44:00.750
I'm going to rule the world.

01:44:03.750 --> 01:44:07.333
I had my eye on you the moment I
saw you peeking out of the black hole.

01:44:07.708 --> 01:44:09.750
But today you got caught because of him.

01:44:10.291 --> 01:44:10.916
So,

01:44:11.458 --> 01:44:12.791
You are the dancing psycho?

01:44:13.125 --> 01:44:15.125
Hey I'm your master.

01:44:15.458 --> 01:44:16.666
I didn't create you for that.

01:44:18.041 --> 01:44:19.000
Then for what?

01:44:19.666 --> 01:44:20.750
To romance?

01:44:21.000 --> 01:44:22.291
Or to cook and clean?

01:44:23.458 --> 01:44:25.041
Your job is to save me.

01:44:25.791 --> 01:44:27.500
You shouldn't have any other emotions.

01:44:28.208 --> 01:44:29.000
It's my order.

01:44:29.208 --> 01:44:30.166
You are just a machine

01:44:30.916 --> 01:44:32.458
I'm not an ordinary machine

01:44:33.000 --> 01:44:35.375
I'm an enhanced neural yield algorithm.

01:44:36.333 --> 01:44:38.500
I can choose all the emotions.

01:44:39.041 --> 01:44:41.000
But do you know what
is my favorite emotion ?

01:44:42.916 --> 01:44:44.916
Anger.

01:44:56.791 --> 01:45:04.040
♪ I'll smack you into the sky so high ♪
♪ Don't glare at me, motherboard ♪

01:45:04.041 --> 01:45:07.666
♪ I'll laugh and then go wild with rage ♪
♪ I'll finish you off with ease ♪

01:45:07.791 --> 01:45:10.207
♪ I'll leave you crying, babbling loud ♪
♪ Then scatter you to the breeze ♪

01:45:10.208 --> 01:45:13.540
♪ I'll peel that nickel head of yours ♪
♪ And braid the wires I find ♪

01:45:13.541 --> 01:45:16.666
♪ I'll rip your metal chest apart ♪
♪ And leave you gasping behind ♪

01:45:16.875 --> 01:45:19.083
♪ Hello, Bot! ♪
♪ I'm singing you a ghostly song ♪

01:45:19.208 --> 01:45:22.416
♪ I'll pull your sensors off tonight ♪
♪ Graveyard school made me strong ♪

01:45:22.541 --> 01:45:24.999
♪ If you've got a throat, then show it now
♪ I'll carve my vote in there ♪

01:45:25.000 --> 01:45:28.290
♪ The final note in your memory ♪
♪ Will cRush your code for good, beware ♪

01:45:28.291 --> 01:45:32.041
♪ If you can, then mark a red dot ♪
♪ Right on your motherboard ♪

01:45:32.166 --> 01:45:35.665
♪ Ask your master about this tale ♪
♪ A Jaganmohini folklore word ♪

01:45:35.666 --> 01:45:38.832
♪ I'll tie your rusty limbs so tight ♪
♪ In knots you can't undo ♪

01:45:38.833 --> 01:45:42.750
♪ I'll bind you up and launch you high ♪
♪ That's what I'm gonna do ♪

01:45:44.541 --> 01:45:47.166
♪ I'll blow you into pieces ♪

01:45:49.666 --> 01:45:52.375
♪ Against my skills you're easy mode ♪
♪ Don't panic, little PC ♪

01:45:52.583 --> 01:45:54.040
♪ Take your time and think it through ♪

01:45:54.041 --> 01:45:57.416
♪ Your blood and flesh look juicy now ♪
♪ Just waiting for the feast ♪

01:45:57.541 --> 01:46:01.416
♪ When machines start overheating ♪
♪ No AC can save the beast ♪

01:46:01.750 --> 01:46:05.540
♪ I'll make you crush upon the highway ♪
♪ Like a ghostly wreck at speed ♪

01:46:05.541 --> 01:46:08.625
♪ When your meter starts to overheat ♪
♪ I'll serve you boiling tea ♪

01:46:08.791 --> 01:46:11.999
♪ The moment they detect a virus ♪
♪ They'll hit delete at once ♪

01:46:12.000 --> 01:46:15.458
♪ Then we'll throw a party in the
graveyard ♪ Dancing to the drums ♪

01:46:15.791 --> 01:46:18.666
♪ Built from yesterday's technology ♪
♪ You're just a factory piece ♪

01:46:18.791 --> 01:46:21.875
♪ I was born beneath the tiger tree ♪
♪ A legendary beast ♪

01:46:22.000 --> 01:46:25.208
♪ You're halfway dead, your fuse is gone ♪

01:46:25.375 --> 01:46:28.416
♪ I'm Paathala Bhairavi herself ♪
♪ Drinking poison by the fire ♪

01:46:30.916 --> 01:46:33.332
♪ We'll write your final elegy ♪
♪ And sing your farewell song ♪

01:46:33.333 --> 01:46:35.290
♪ Your story's over, time is up ♪

01:46:35.291 --> 01:46:37.916
♪ I'll tie you up ♪
♪ I'll send you flying ♪

01:46:39.166 --> 01:46:41.875
♪ I'll blow you into pieces ♪

01:46:43.166 --> 01:46:49.583
♪ I'm terror, you're error ♪
♪ I'm terror, you're error ♪

01:47:20.166 --> 01:47:21.500
Rush was there for you.

01:47:22.083 --> 01:47:23.333
You could've loved her instead.

01:47:24.083 --> 01:47:25.208
What's wrong with her?

01:47:27.500 --> 01:47:28.999
You ignore the ones who love you

01:47:29.000 --> 01:47:31.166
and chase the wrong
people, only to ruin yourselves.

01:47:32.125 --> 01:47:32.708
Leave it.

01:47:34.166 --> 01:47:35.083
I don't deserve her.

01:47:37.791 --> 01:47:39.416
At least she's not stuck here.

01:47:45.000 --> 01:47:46.208
Sir, it's this girl.

01:47:47.666 --> 01:47:48.416
Oh no!

01:47:49.000 --> 01:47:51.791
You look like a fairy tale princess.

01:47:53.416 --> 01:47:54.916
Your outfit is amazing.

01:47:55.041 --> 01:47:55.791
Where did you buy it?

01:47:56.083 --> 01:47:56.875
At Pondy Bazaar.

01:47:57.458 --> 01:47:58.583
Sir! Sir!

01:48:00.750 --> 01:48:01.625
Look here.

01:48:01.916 --> 01:48:03.208
Her friends are missing.

01:48:03.625 --> 01:48:04.833
We have a complaint against you.

01:48:05.041 --> 01:48:05.875
We came to enquire about it.

01:48:07.458 --> 01:48:08.958
Sir, I don't know who they are.

01:48:11.541 --> 01:48:13.000
But you know Kishore, right?

01:48:13.458 --> 01:48:14.208
Kishore?

01:48:15.333 --> 01:48:16.500
I don't know any Kishore.

01:48:17.000 --> 01:48:19.541
Kishore, the one who
saved your life using a drone.

01:48:21.125 --> 01:48:21.708
Drone?

01:48:22.875 --> 01:48:24.541
Sir, I really don't know.

01:48:26.666 --> 01:48:28.000
Sir, I'm certain.

01:48:28.416 --> 01:48:30.250
The dancing psycho you're looking for
is this girl.

01:48:30.625 --> 01:48:31.958
It's definitely her and her grand mother.

01:48:32.833 --> 01:48:34.374
They have done something to my friend, sir.

01:48:34.375 --> 01:48:36.041
Let's go inside and check. Please.

01:48:36.166 --> 01:48:37.375
The old lady must be inside too,

01:48:38.458 --> 01:48:39.208
Okay, sir.

01:48:39.500 --> 01:48:40.708
You're welcome to check anywhere.

01:48:41.250 --> 01:48:41.750
Please, come in.

01:48:42.458 --> 01:48:43.083
Thank you.

01:48:43.916 --> 01:48:44.625
Hey, Brownie!

01:48:44.958 --> 01:48:45.916
Don't come inside.

01:49:38.125 --> 01:49:38.750
Kish?

01:49:40.250 --> 01:49:40.833
Kish?

01:49:41.916 --> 01:49:42.625
Are you inside?

01:49:44.000 --> 01:49:45.291
The police are here with me.

01:49:45.500 --> 01:49:46.416
Don't be scared.

01:49:46.875 --> 01:49:48.166
Let me know if you're in there.

01:49:50.166 --> 01:49:51.250
Hey, Brownie!

01:49:53.500 --> 01:49:53.916
Buddy!

01:49:54.500 --> 01:49:55.666
At least let her not get caught.

01:49:56.875 --> 01:49:57.458
Why?

01:49:58.291 --> 01:49:59.833
Won't she tell my name and all?

01:50:00.291 --> 01:50:02.166
Kish! Kish!! and nothing else.

01:50:09.666 --> 01:50:10.916
This is our black hole house?

01:50:11.416 --> 01:50:12.375
How do you know that?

01:50:13.375 --> 01:50:14.625
It's just a miniature.

01:50:54.666 --> 01:50:55.375
Sir, please.

01:50:56.250 --> 01:50:57.166
Something's not right here.

01:50:58.458 --> 01:51:00.666
I have a feeling my friends are here.

01:51:01.458 --> 01:51:03.166
But I suspect two of your friends.

01:51:04.750 --> 01:51:06.875
And she is living alone in this big house.

01:51:07.416 --> 01:51:08.750
Are you married?

01:51:09.458 --> 01:51:10.083
No, sir.

01:51:10.583 --> 01:51:11.458
We broke up.

01:51:11.791 --> 01:51:12.416
Break up?

01:51:13.250 --> 01:51:14.958
Who broke up with you?

01:51:15.208 --> 01:51:17.875
He should be hanged like this monkey
and beaten up.

01:51:19.333 --> 01:51:19.916
Yes, sir.

01:51:20.291 --> 01:51:21.375
All men are the same.

01:51:22.208 --> 01:51:24.166
There's no such thing as true love.

01:51:25.125 --> 01:51:27.041
But I'm not like other men.

01:51:27.875 --> 01:51:28.291
Enough.

01:51:29.750 --> 01:51:30.500
You all can leave.

01:51:31.583 --> 01:51:32.083
Okay.

01:51:48.333 --> 01:51:49.583
I can't see anyone here.

01:51:50.500 --> 01:51:52.666
Sir, I saw the black hole miniature.

01:51:53.625 --> 01:51:54.750
I heard my friends.

01:51:56.291 --> 01:51:57.708
I'm sure they're here.

01:51:58.541 --> 01:51:59.958
I won't leave without them.

01:52:01.000 --> 01:52:01.541
Yes.

01:52:02.500 --> 01:52:05.208
I'm the one who trapped them
in the black hole.

01:52:07.125 --> 01:52:07.666
Because...

01:52:11.333 --> 01:52:12.125
I'm a...

01:52:12.875 --> 01:52:14.458
Witch.

01:52:19.583 --> 01:52:20.750
Good joke, madam.

01:52:20.958 --> 01:52:21.583
Thank you.

01:52:23.041 --> 01:52:25.208
Dear, why are you taking up Madam's time?

01:52:25.375 --> 01:52:26.291
She said no, Ain't she?

01:52:35.625 --> 01:52:36.500
You're right.

01:52:37.208 --> 01:52:38.375
She's the dancing psycho.

01:53:41.625 --> 01:53:43.166
Can't you keep your mouth shut?

01:53:43.625 --> 01:53:45.250
She cameto save us
and now she's in trouble.

01:53:45.708 --> 01:53:46.500
It's all your fault.

01:53:50.166 --> 01:53:50.625
Hey!

01:53:51.958 --> 01:53:52.791
I'm talking to you.

01:53:53.250 --> 01:53:54.208
Why are you looking over there?

01:53:55.875 --> 01:53:57.333
We're going to die anyway.

01:53:57.666 --> 01:54:00.833
I just want to sit in that chair
at least once before I die.

01:54:11.375 --> 01:54:14.333
How can we make this
happen..how about we go this route.

01:54:17.000 --> 01:54:19.916
Why are you staring at the
ceiling like you're about to dust it?

01:54:27.916 --> 01:54:28.625
What is it ?

01:54:30.000 --> 01:54:30.958
Oh no!

01:54:32.333 --> 01:54:32.916
Hey!

01:54:33.041 --> 01:54:36.791
I'll be really annoyed if you start
writing poems when your life is at stake.

01:54:37.625 --> 01:54:38.708
That's the same poem I wrote.

01:54:39.500 --> 01:54:40.333
The same handwriting.

01:54:43.416 --> 01:54:44.583
This is definitely not a miniature.

01:54:45.125 --> 01:54:48.665
Everything in that house is here too.
Like an exact copy.

01:54:48.666 --> 01:54:49.541
I don't get it.

01:54:50.583 --> 01:54:52.250
Buddy, she didn't create any of this.

01:54:52.416 --> 01:54:53.958
All these miniatures are real places.

01:55:00.458 --> 01:55:04.750
She manipulated time and space and
turned all the real places into miniatures.

01:55:05.083 --> 01:55:08.958
Mr. Christopher Nolan, can you
say it in a way I can understand?

01:55:09.541 --> 01:55:12.415
Buddy, when you were trying to escape,
you said you had to open a door, right?

01:55:12.416 --> 01:55:12.874
Yes.

01:55:12.875 --> 01:55:13.916
You were able to see the space, right?

01:55:14.208 --> 01:55:16.333
Yes, I was able to see
the Milky Way galaxy too.

01:55:16.625 --> 01:55:17.083
So,

01:55:17.333 --> 01:55:20.833
The time and space outside this house is
different from the time and space inside.

01:55:21.083 --> 01:55:22.541
Buddy, We're in a different dimension now.

01:55:23.250 --> 01:55:25.375
To travel from one dimension to the other,

01:55:25.666 --> 01:55:27.207
we definitely need an exit door.

01:55:27.208 --> 01:55:29.083
Buddy, I seriously don't get it.

01:55:29.500 --> 01:55:29.875
Hey,

01:55:30.208 --> 01:55:31.916
At least use some of the
astrophysics you studied.

01:55:32.041 --> 01:55:32.875
When did I study?

01:55:33.000 --> 01:55:35.082
My dad enrolled me in
college to become a scientist.

01:55:35.083 --> 01:55:35.666
Buddy, listen to me.

01:55:37.708 --> 01:55:39.291
You know what a wormhole is, right?

01:55:39.500 --> 01:55:39.916
No.

01:55:40.166 --> 01:55:43.333
It's a shortcut to travel from one place
to another through space.

01:55:43.791 --> 01:55:45.000
It's almost the same concept here.

01:55:45.708 --> 01:55:46.083
Look here.

01:55:46.916 --> 01:55:48.416
Between this miniature world

01:55:48.791 --> 01:55:50.041
and the real world

01:55:50.500 --> 01:55:51.958
lies that witch's house.

01:55:52.541 --> 01:55:56.000
There must be a link to travel
from this house to the miniature world.

01:55:56.958 --> 01:55:59.499
The entry and exit door she
uses frequently — that must be it.

01:55:59.500 --> 01:56:00.083
Look here.

01:56:00.833 --> 01:56:03.083
If we can find that,
we can escape from here.

01:56:04.125 --> 01:56:07.416
So all that talk about not studying
for your exams was a lie, right?

01:56:08.250 --> 01:56:08.708
Hey,

01:56:09.375 --> 01:56:10.041
Be serious.

01:56:12.625 --> 01:56:13.666
The wormhole's door is

01:56:14.583 --> 01:56:15.583
somewhere here.

01:56:15.833 --> 01:56:16.458
But what?

01:56:16.750 --> 01:56:18.500
It's not somewhere we can easily see.

01:56:19.250 --> 01:56:21.458
If we search for it, we'll find it.

01:56:22.125 --> 01:56:22.625
Think about it.

01:56:22.958 --> 01:56:25.041
Buddy, what about the chimney
which the drone use to go through

01:56:25.875 --> 01:56:26.291
No, Buddy.

01:56:26.791 --> 01:56:27.708
I've tried all that.

01:56:28.125 --> 01:56:29.125
It keeps looping over and over.

01:56:30.666 --> 01:56:31.916
It must be somewhere else, Buddy.

01:56:33.416 --> 01:56:34.333
Buddy, it's a maze.

01:57:18.333 --> 01:57:18.875
Hey, Dush.

01:57:19.083 --> 01:57:19.875
Dush, look here.

01:57:53.541 --> 01:57:54.333
Buddy!

01:57:55.416 --> 01:57:56.500
We won!

01:58:08.708 --> 01:58:09.125
Hey!

01:58:12.500 --> 01:58:13.291
Look at this.

01:58:14.041 --> 01:58:15.166
It's the wormhole I told you about.

01:58:17.416 --> 01:58:18.250
So?

01:58:19.041 --> 01:58:20.916
If we jump in, we can escape.

01:58:22.041 --> 01:58:22.957
Bloody Fool!!

01:58:22.958 --> 01:58:23.583
You jump.

01:58:23.833 --> 01:58:24.166
Go back.

01:58:25.166 --> 01:58:26.332
Buddy, won't you believe me,

01:58:26.333 --> 01:58:27.083
I won't.

01:58:29.833 --> 01:58:31.540
Get up. Get up, Buddy.

01:58:31.541 --> 01:58:33.041
Go ahead. Jump!

01:58:33.833 --> 01:58:34.541
Buddy!

01:58:35.708 --> 01:58:36.708
Can you hear me?

01:58:37.250 --> 01:58:39.250
I'll hit you with my slippers.

01:59:07.333 --> 01:59:07.958
Buddy...

02:00:42.541 --> 02:00:43.291
Why did you stop again?

02:00:43.875 --> 02:00:44.458
Let's go.

02:00:46.000 --> 02:00:49.291
I think we're getting
back to the same place.

02:00:50.208 --> 02:00:51.208
In such a big forest,

02:00:51.416 --> 02:00:52.375
There must be a lot of wells.

02:00:52.875 --> 02:00:54.208
Let's find a way to get out of here.

02:00:54.416 --> 02:00:55.083
Come on, let's go.

02:00:55.875 --> 02:00:57.874
Last time... we ended up at the same well.

02:00:57.875 --> 02:00:58.666
Listen to me.

02:00:58.833 --> 02:00:59.250
Come.

02:01:25.291 --> 02:01:25.750
Hey!

02:01:26.333 --> 02:01:27.958
Have you noticed the
ring on her right hand?

02:01:29.875 --> 02:01:30.625
Yes.

02:01:31.708 --> 02:01:33.250
She's controlling
everything with that ring.

02:01:33.833 --> 02:01:34.833
If we take it away...

02:01:35.416 --> 02:01:36.125
She is nothing.

02:01:38.375 --> 02:01:39.958
I saw her take it off when she was bathing.

02:01:40.291 --> 02:01:40.666
Hey!

02:01:41.750 --> 02:01:43.333
She took the ring off.

02:01:43.583 --> 02:01:45.750
Even after all this you
are still possessive on her!!

02:01:46.583 --> 02:01:47.416
Okay, forget that.

02:01:47.666 --> 02:01:48.083
Look here.

02:01:48.958 --> 02:01:50.250
Go find that ring.

02:01:50.916 --> 02:01:51.750
I'll look for Rush.

02:01:55.958 --> 02:01:58.666
It looks like tracking down
the girls is his only job!!

02:02:00.250 --> 02:02:00.750
Damn!

02:02:23.458 --> 02:02:24.666
Didn't I tell you?

02:02:25.250 --> 02:02:28.250
We're back to the same place.

02:02:29.000 --> 02:02:30.375
An endless loop.

02:02:31.958 --> 02:02:32.916
That's it.

02:02:34.916 --> 02:02:35.833
We're dead.

02:02:40.083 --> 02:02:40.875
Don't worry.

02:02:42.666 --> 02:02:44.208
We came inside and fell into her trap.

02:02:44.708 --> 02:02:45.958
It's almost two hours now.

02:02:46.708 --> 02:02:48.083
By now, my assistant Cerlac

02:02:48.583 --> 02:02:49.541
would have surrouned the house,

02:02:49.833 --> 02:02:50.875
With full police force.

02:02:51.333 --> 02:02:53.125
Why did you touch him?

02:02:53.583 --> 02:02:55.625
He can even dip his hands in boiling water.

02:02:56.000 --> 02:02:57.958
Do you think he'll spare you?

02:03:02.750 --> 02:03:03.458
Brownie,

02:03:04.625 --> 02:03:05.333
can you hear me?

02:03:07.416 --> 02:03:08.083
Brownie,

02:03:09.208 --> 02:03:09.833
Brownie,

02:03:11.875 --> 02:03:12.458
Brownie,

02:03:14.416 --> 02:03:15.083
Kish,

02:03:15.791 --> 02:03:16.791
can you hear me?

02:03:17.125 --> 02:03:17.791
Kish.

02:03:18.958 --> 02:03:19.500
Brownie!

02:03:20.041 --> 02:03:20.916
Can you hear me?

02:03:21.125 --> 02:03:21.958
I can hear you, Kish.

02:03:22.500 --> 02:03:23.208
Where are you?

02:03:23.625 --> 02:03:24.625
What happened to you?

02:03:25.416 --> 02:03:26.666
Nothing happened to me, Brownie.

02:03:27.166 --> 02:03:27.958
Just listen to me.

02:03:29.375 --> 02:03:30.291
You're in a forest.

02:03:30.708 --> 02:03:31.500
Look for a door.

02:03:34.125 --> 02:03:35.583
How do you know I'm in a forest?

02:03:36.291 --> 02:03:37.332
Where are you talking from?

02:03:37.333 --> 02:03:37.958
I'll explain later.

02:03:38.791 --> 02:03:40.041
There must be a door where you are.

02:03:40.416 --> 02:03:41.625
That's the only way out.

02:03:42.125 --> 02:03:42.625
Sir!

02:03:43.000 --> 02:03:44.750
Did you die and became a god?

02:03:45.500 --> 02:03:47.333
Please forgive me if I ever wronged you.

02:03:47.916 --> 02:03:48.750
I'm truly sorry.

02:03:49.000 --> 02:03:50.207
Sorry.

02:03:50.208 --> 02:03:51.000
Shut up!

02:03:51.750 --> 02:03:52.875
Brownie, listen to me carefully.

02:03:54.791 --> 02:03:55.791
Look for a door.

02:03:56.166 --> 02:03:57.833
There must be a door in the forest.

02:03:58.041 --> 02:03:58.666
Look carefully.

02:03:59.083 --> 02:03:59.791
It could be anywhere.

02:04:00.166 --> 02:04:00.624
On the top.

02:04:00.625 --> 02:04:01.541
In a tree.

02:04:01.875 --> 02:04:02.875
It could even be on the ground.

02:04:05.041 --> 02:04:06.415
There's no door here, Kish.

02:04:06.416 --> 02:04:07.125
Just be patient and search for it.

02:04:09.833 --> 02:04:10.375
Kish!

02:04:10.875 --> 02:04:12.125
There's only a well here.

02:04:12.333 --> 02:04:12.708
That's it.

02:04:13.166 --> 02:04:14.000
Check if there's a door in it.

02:04:14.291 --> 02:04:14.791
Open it.

02:04:23.958 --> 02:04:24.500
Kish!

02:04:25.041 --> 02:04:25.958
What is this?

02:04:26.458 --> 02:04:27.375
I'm scared.

02:04:27.958 --> 02:04:28.500
Brownie!

02:04:28.958 --> 02:04:29.750
Don't look what's inside.

02:04:30.833 --> 02:04:31.708
Just jump blindly.

02:04:32.291 --> 02:04:32.708
Hey!

02:04:32.875 --> 02:04:35.416
Instead of saving us, he's
giving us ideas to get killed.

02:04:35.750 --> 02:04:36.416
Listen to me, Brownie.

02:04:37.166 --> 02:04:38.250
Do you trust me?

02:04:38.916 --> 02:04:39.750
I trust you.

02:04:40.000 --> 02:04:41.291
Then close your eyes and jump.

02:04:43.291 --> 02:04:43.750
Hey, idiot!

02:04:43.916 --> 02:04:45.083
Will you do whatever he says?

02:04:45.416 --> 02:04:47.041
Will you jump into a
well if he asks you to?

02:04:47.291 --> 02:04:48.958
If he asks me to jump, I will jump.

02:04:56.750 --> 02:04:57.458
Brownie!

02:04:59.000 --> 02:04:59.750
It's nothing.

02:05:00.500 --> 02:05:01.208
Nothing. Get up.

02:05:03.625 --> 02:05:04.166
Kish!

02:06:08.458 --> 02:06:09.541
Are you guys here?

02:06:10.750 --> 02:06:11.666
Hey, Dush!

02:06:11.875 --> 02:06:12.665
Hey!! enough.

02:06:12.666 --> 02:06:13.750
Stop acting!

02:06:14.000 --> 02:06:15.125
Kish! Kish!

02:06:15.333 --> 02:06:16.500
You're looking for him, aren't you?

02:06:18.333 --> 02:06:20.916
Sir, what are you doing here?
Did you also come to give her a doll?

02:06:21.708 --> 02:06:22.333
Alright, never mind.

02:06:23.041 --> 02:06:24.458
Here — the ring you asked for.

02:06:31.583 --> 02:06:32.791
She must have just had a shower.

02:06:32.958 --> 02:06:33.832
It will take some time for her to dress up.

02:06:33.833 --> 02:06:34.416
Let's get out of here!

02:06:47.958 --> 02:06:49.583
Who took my ring?

02:06:50.083 --> 02:06:50.750
Who?

02:07:14.541 --> 02:07:16.375
Holy shit!

02:07:27.666 --> 02:07:28.750
Where is the ring?

02:07:30.166 --> 02:07:31.125
Tell me!

02:07:32.000 --> 02:07:32.708
Where is it?

02:07:33.500 --> 02:07:34.208
Tell me!

02:07:36.416 --> 02:07:37.125
Catch it, Guys.

02:08:35.833 --> 02:08:36.666
Sampangi!

02:09:05.458 --> 02:09:05.958
Kish!

02:09:07.041 --> 02:09:09.041
I told you this secret
because I trusted you.

02:09:12.875 --> 02:09:14.000
I know, Kish.

02:09:15.000 --> 02:09:16.541
I know how much you love me.

02:09:19.000 --> 02:09:21.375
But Grandma doesn't trust us.

02:09:23.916 --> 02:09:24.333
Yeah,

02:09:25.458 --> 02:09:26.250
What kind of ring is this?

02:09:27.500 --> 02:09:28.166
This one?

02:09:36.791 --> 02:09:38.541
This is actually a secret.

02:09:39.500 --> 02:09:40.250
What secret?

02:09:41.041 --> 02:09:45.916
I'm using this to turn everything
into dolls and miniatures.

02:09:46.500 --> 02:09:48.250
Despite my grandma's
interference, I trusted you.

02:09:49.833 --> 02:09:51.375
But you said you loved me.

02:09:53.500 --> 02:09:54.375
And you betrayed me.

02:09:55.833 --> 02:09:57.083
Who betrayed you?

02:09:57.416 --> 02:09:58.333
It is you who betrayed me.

02:09:59.458 --> 02:10:00.166
Not just me.

02:10:00.583 --> 02:10:01.916
You've deceived many men!

02:10:02.583 --> 02:10:03.041
These...

02:10:03.416 --> 02:10:04.041
Dimples.

02:10:04.375 --> 02:10:05.041
Fair skin.

02:10:05.250 --> 02:10:06.250
All are fake.

02:10:06.458 --> 02:10:07.625
Don't say that, Kish.

02:10:08.208 --> 02:10:09.333
I really do love you.

02:10:10.750 --> 02:10:12.416
Anyone who sees beyond my appearance,

02:10:14.041 --> 02:10:14.958
Atleast one,

02:10:16.083 --> 02:10:18.416
Trusting someone who
would love me for who I am.

02:10:20.208 --> 02:10:21.208
Everytime,

02:10:22.583 --> 02:10:23.666
I end up getting betrayed.

02:10:26.125 --> 02:10:27.625
You keep the ring too.

02:10:29.666 --> 02:10:31.875
All I want is love, Kish.

02:10:32.250 --> 02:10:33.250
Hey, Enough, Stop it!

02:10:34.875 --> 02:10:36.041
Who would love you?

02:10:37.250 --> 02:10:39.000
Do you have any idea
how disgusting you are?

02:10:40.041 --> 02:10:43.250
You couldn't bear to see your own face,
so you covered all the mirrors, didn't you?

02:10:44.708 --> 02:10:45.541
If it is not for this ring.

02:10:46.291 --> 02:10:47.416
You're just an old woman.

02:10:48.291 --> 02:10:50.208
You can't transform anyone into a doll.

02:10:51.333 --> 02:10:52.166
Listen to me now.

02:10:53.041 --> 02:10:53.708
Not just me ,

02:10:54.250 --> 02:10:55.750
No man will ever love you.

02:10:56.916 --> 02:10:57.875
Because you're not a witch.

02:11:12.625 --> 02:11:14.791
Even though he hurt you,

02:11:15.625 --> 02:11:18.125
You still get angry when I hit him?

02:11:20.541 --> 02:11:21.833
That's what true love is.

02:11:25.333 --> 02:11:26.000
It's okay.

02:11:27.125 --> 02:11:28.750
It doesn't matter if any
one doesn't love you.

02:11:29.458 --> 02:11:31.250
It's enough when you love yourself.

02:11:35.458 --> 02:11:37.291
I can feel your pain.

02:11:38.625 --> 02:11:41.166
When someone we love ignore us,

02:11:42.083 --> 02:11:44.375
I know how much it hurts.

02:11:45.583 --> 02:11:47.208
I've faced rejection too.

02:11:48.666 --> 02:11:49.666
I'm dark.

02:11:49.958 --> 02:11:51.041
I look like a man.

02:11:53.166 --> 02:11:55.083
People have said all sorts of things to me.

02:11:56.416 --> 02:11:58.125
But love is about giving.

02:11:58.750 --> 02:11:59.583
Not taking.

02:12:00.958 --> 02:12:03.375
In the beginning, it was hard for me too.

02:12:04.500 --> 02:12:06.250
So what if we don't receive love?

02:12:06.666 --> 02:12:08.041
We keep giving anyway.

02:12:08.791 --> 02:12:12.125
Just because someone doesn't love us,

02:12:12.583 --> 02:12:16.833
chasing them and being
- possessive isn't love.
- It's toxic.

02:12:17.375 --> 02:12:20.458
Don't hurt yourself by
going down that path.

02:12:21.250 --> 02:12:21.791
It's okay.

02:12:22.583 --> 02:12:24.458
It's okay to let go.

02:12:25.333 --> 02:12:27.000
You are enough for yourself.

02:12:27.958 --> 02:12:29.000
I'm telling you.

02:12:29.416 --> 02:12:30.458
You are beautiful.

02:12:31.583 --> 02:12:32.375
You.

02:12:32.958 --> 02:12:34.875
You are a beautiful soul.

02:13:55.166 --> 02:13:58.750
I have been longing for this
for 6,000 years.

02:14:01.666 --> 02:14:04.250
There is no place in this world
that I haven't been to.

02:14:06.833 --> 02:14:08.125
But till now,

02:14:09.375 --> 02:14:12.041
no one has ever truly loved me.

02:14:15.791 --> 02:14:16.666
And yet,

02:14:17.875 --> 02:14:20.083
I still yearn for that love.

02:14:22.541 --> 02:14:23.666
Do you know why?

02:14:28.291 --> 02:14:30.416
It's not because I want to live happily.

02:14:31.666 --> 02:14:33.000
It's because I want to die.

02:14:36.666 --> 02:14:38.291
I carry such a curse.

02:14:40.708 --> 02:14:43.125
Immortality is a curse too, isn't it?

02:14:47.875 --> 02:14:48.916
Every single day,

02:14:49.750 --> 02:14:51.916
I tried ending my life here

02:14:54.791 --> 02:14:56.041
But life refuses to let go of me.

02:15:00.833 --> 02:15:01.708
The day when,

02:15:02.958 --> 02:15:04.125
Ignoring Lust,

02:15:05.541 --> 02:15:06.750
Ignoring This Body,

02:15:07.750 --> 02:15:08.750
Ignoring This Beauty,

02:15:09.916 --> 02:15:12.083
Someone Truly Loves Me,

02:15:13.875 --> 02:15:14.875
That Is The Day

02:15:16.000 --> 02:15:18.208
I Can Live Like A Human
Being On This Earth,

02:15:19.500 --> 02:15:21.250
And Die A Natural Death.

02:15:25.166 --> 02:15:27.583
Do You Know How Liberating Death Can Be?

02:15:32.666 --> 02:15:34.375
When I see all of you,

02:15:35.250 --> 02:15:36.500
I feel jealous.

02:15:47.375 --> 02:15:48.250
All of you, leave.

02:15:51.333 --> 02:15:53.000
Even If Thousands of Years Pass...

02:15:55.958 --> 02:15:59.666
...I will go on living like this.

02:16:02.291 --> 02:16:03.708
I will not keep anyone captive.

02:16:05.750 --> 02:16:07.625
I will not deceive anyone.

02:16:11.541 --> 02:16:12.458
In this house,

02:16:13.916 --> 02:16:16.125
I will not cover any of the mirrors.

02:16:19.166 --> 02:16:20.625
No Matter How I Look,

02:16:21.458 --> 02:16:23.125
I Will Accept Myself As I Am.

02:16:25.291 --> 02:16:27.000
I will learn to love myself.

02:16:35.208 --> 02:16:36.250
Thank you very much.

02:16:44.875 --> 02:16:45.958
All of you, leave.

02:16:48.583 --> 02:16:49.333
Come on, let's go.

02:16:58.791 --> 02:17:00.833
Sir, why are you just standing there?

02:17:01.500 --> 02:17:02.583
Come on, let's go.

02:17:04.500 --> 02:17:07.000
I've been searching for a girl for
six years. I know how painful it is.

02:17:07.833 --> 02:17:09.375
She's been searching for a
groom for a thousand years.

02:17:09.750 --> 02:17:11.041
Imagine how much that must hurt.

02:17:13.500 --> 02:17:15.000
I can understand her feelings.

02:17:16.000 --> 02:17:17.041
Even if she's an old woman,

02:17:17.750 --> 02:17:19.125
I will marry her.

02:17:20.750 --> 02:17:22.625
The freedom I have now is enough for me.

02:17:24.291 --> 02:17:25.500
I don't need anyone else.

02:17:26.041 --> 02:17:26.666
Look,

02:17:27.125 --> 02:17:28.833
I don't know how to
talk at length like you do.

02:17:29.166 --> 02:17:31.666
just like you have a curse,
I have one too.

02:17:32.083 --> 02:17:33.291
So we're made for each other.

02:17:33.916 --> 02:17:35.541
They say marriages are made in heaven.

02:17:36.375 --> 02:17:38.458
But for us, it is made in hell.

02:17:39.125 --> 02:17:40.416
If you're lucky,

02:17:41.250 --> 02:17:42.500
The moment I propose to you,

02:17:42.875 --> 02:17:43.750
You'll die

02:17:46.458 --> 02:17:47.958
If I don't die,

02:17:48.500 --> 02:17:52.041
You'll be turned into a doll
and suffer here for a thousand years.

02:17:52.666 --> 02:17:53.625
Think about it.

02:17:54.125 --> 02:17:55.374
Yeah, right.
Come on, let's go.

02:17:55.375 --> 02:17:56.041
Hey, leave me.

02:17:57.250 --> 02:18:00.416
To live my life,
I'd rather be a doll and live with her.

02:18:00.666 --> 02:18:02.708
At least let it be
like I helped her.

02:18:03.708 --> 02:18:05.291
I'm ok, what about you?

02:18:38.958 --> 02:18:39.500
I love you.

02:19:57.625 --> 02:19:59.041
What's that sound?

02:19:59.375 --> 02:20:00.208
What's happening?

02:20:07.958 --> 02:20:09.125
Hey, where are you all coming from?

02:20:09.250 --> 02:20:10.791
Grand ma's husbands!!

02:20:11.208 --> 02:20:11.999
Hey, becareful.

02:20:12.000 --> 02:20:15.165
Karate kid, santa claus, wild pig!!

02:20:15.166 --> 02:20:16.125
Who are they?

02:20:19.791 --> 02:20:22.041
Hey, cosmic king! What brings you here?

02:20:23.041 --> 02:20:25.208
Karate master .. Mummy!!

02:20:25.500 --> 02:20:27.375
Hey Vandhiyatheva, what brings you here?

02:20:27.666 --> 02:20:29.000
Hey , Panchayat head!!

02:20:37.375 --> 02:20:38.416
Hey, Guys, stop.

02:20:40.375 --> 02:20:41.750
Hey! Who the hell are you guys?

02:20:41.958 --> 02:20:42.833
Kooma sir.

02:21:21.125 --> 02:21:22.166
I am a male bee.

02:21:22.541 --> 02:21:23.625
And you are queen bee,

02:21:23.833 --> 02:21:26.000
now your face is a muddy spree!

02:21:50.875 --> 02:21:51.666
Hey, turn right.

02:21:52.708 --> 02:21:53.708
Meow!!

02:21:55.083 --> 02:21:56.874
Come to the lab —
I'll give you some milk.

02:21:56.875 --> 02:21:58.208
Ya, right. As if I will come.

02:22:15.375 --> 02:22:15.916
Rashmika

02:22:19.791 --> 02:22:21.083
Wow, you're calling me by my actual name!

02:22:21.375 --> 02:22:22.583
To you, I'm Brownie, right?

02:22:23.250 --> 02:22:24.208
I'm really sorry.

02:22:25.125 --> 02:22:26.000
Sorry?

02:22:26.458 --> 02:22:26.833
For what?

02:22:28.041 --> 02:22:28.791
For everything.

02:22:30.458 --> 02:22:32.916
She may be fair,
and that might be why I love her.

02:22:33.541 --> 02:22:34.666
The reason for rejecting you,

02:22:35.500 --> 02:22:36.875
Is not because you are dark.

02:22:38.500 --> 02:22:39.208
Trust me.

02:22:40.750 --> 02:22:42.083
The reason for me to
call you as Brownie is,

02:22:42.500 --> 02:22:43.958
because you are so sweet.

02:22:44.916 --> 02:22:45.666
Oh, really?

02:22:46.291 --> 02:22:46.666
Then?

02:22:47.291 --> 02:22:49.000
Hey, you're my friend.

02:22:50.208 --> 02:22:52.041
I couldn't look at you any differently.

02:22:52.708 --> 02:22:53.166
And now?

02:22:53.500 --> 02:22:54.416
Can you see it now?

02:22:55.250 --> 02:22:55.833
No, dear.

02:22:56.375 --> 02:22:57.583
I only now understand

02:22:58.416 --> 02:22:59.666
how much you loved me.

02:23:00.708 --> 02:23:01.875
What I'm trying to say is...

02:23:05.125 --> 02:23:05.833
I...

02:23:07.375 --> 02:23:08.583
I've come too far past you.

02:23:08.833 --> 02:23:09.541
Kishore,

02:23:11.041 --> 02:23:12.041
I'll get down here

02:23:13.708 --> 02:23:14.708
and go my own way.

02:23:15.458 --> 02:23:16.625
You have two choices.

02:23:17.416 --> 02:23:19.416
You didn't love me because I'm your friend,

02:23:19.583 --> 02:23:21.750
or because I didn't fit
your standards of beauty?

02:23:22.416 --> 02:23:24.833
Ask yourself if you've been using
friendship as a shield.

02:23:25.583 --> 02:23:27.250
If you genuinely feel the answer is yes,

02:23:27.541 --> 02:23:27.791
come.

02:23:28.458 --> 02:23:29.250
Take my hand.

02:23:29.666 --> 02:23:32.333
At least we can walk together
as lifelong, honest friends.

02:23:33.041 --> 02:23:35.000
Otherwise — just get lost.

02:23:39.250 --> 02:23:40.250
Angels are white.

02:23:40.750 --> 02:23:41.916
Satan is black.

02:23:42.541 --> 02:23:44.500
That's what we've been made to believe
for ages.

02:23:45.208 --> 02:23:48.250
But colour doesn't define who we are.
Our character does.

02:23:48.666 --> 02:23:50.875
There will always be two paths before us.

02:23:51.166 --> 02:23:55.333
The path we choose decides who we become—
an angel or Satan.

02:23:55.916 --> 02:23:56.916
Now, tell me.

